ompatibilité avec SSR","Migration vers Vite 8 Rolldown"],"de":["Vite-Konfiguration","Vite-Plugin-API","Unterstützung für SSR","Migration zu Vite 8 Rolldown"],"pt":["Configuração de plugins","Suporte a SSR","Migração para Vite 8","Desenvolvimento de bibliotecas","Otimização de build"],"ru":["Конфигурация плагинов","Поддержка SSR","Миграция на Vite 8","Разработка библиотек","Оптимизация билда"],"ar":["تكوين الإضافات","دعم SSR","هجرة إلى Vite 8","تنمية المكتبات","تحسين البناء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vite AIエージェント","Vite构建工具","插件API","SSR","Vite 8迁移","如何使用Vite","Vite教程","Vite插件","Vite替代品"],"ja":["Vite AIエージェント","Viteビルドツール","プラグインAPI","SSR","Vite 8ロールダウン移行","Viteの使い方","Viteチュートリアル","Viteプラグイン","Viteの代替"],"ko":["Vite AI 에이전트","Vite 빌드 툴","플러그인 API","SSR","Vite 8 마이그레이션","Vite 사용법","Vite 튜토리얼","Vite 플러그인","Vite 대체"],"es":["cómo usar Vite","qué es Vite","alternativas a Vite","Vite vs Webpack","instalación de Vite","guía de configuración de Vite"],"fr":["comment utiliser Vite","qu''est-ce que Vite","alternatives à Vite","Vite vs Webpack","installation de Vite","guide de configuration de Vite"],"de":["wie man Vite verwendet","was ist Vite","Alternativen zu Vite","Vite vs Webpack","Installation von Vite","Konfigurationsanleitung für Vite"],"pt":["Vite configuração","Vite plugins","Vite SSR","como usar Vite","o que é Vite","Vite vs Webpack","Vite instalação","Vite guia de configuração"],"ru":["Vite конфигурация","Vite плагины","Vite SSR","как использовать Vite","что такое Vite","Vite vs Webpack","Vite установка","Vite руководство по конфигурации"],"ar":["Vite تكوين","Vite إضافات","Vite SSR","كيفية استخدام Vite","ما هي Vite","Vite مقابل Webpack","Vite تثبيت","Vite دليل التكوين"]}},"owner":"antfu","repo":"skills","repoPath":"antfu/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vite","description":"Vite build tool configuration, plugin API, SSR, and Vite 8 Rolldown migration. Use when working with Vite projects, vite.config.ts, Vite plugins, or building libraries/SSR apps with Vite.","version":"2026.1.31","bodyPreview":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](refere","body":"# Vite\n\n> Based on Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered). Vite 8 uses Rolldown bundler and Oxc transformer.\n\nVite is a next-generation frontend build tool with fast dev server (native ESM + HMR) and optimized production builds.\n\n## Preferences\n\n- Use TypeScript: prefer `vite.config.ts`\n- Always use ESM, avoid CommonJS\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | `vite.config.ts`, `defineConfig`, conditional configs, `loadEnv` | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| Features | `import.meta.glob`, asset queries (`?raw`, `?url`), `import.meta.env`, HMR API | [core-features](references/core-features.md) |\n| Plugin API | Vite-specific hooks, virtual modules, plugin ordering | [core-plugin-api](references/core-plugin-api.md) |\n\n## Build & SSR\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Build & SSR | Library mode, SSR middleware mode, `ssrLoadModule`, JavaScript API | [build-and-ssr](references/build-and-ssr.md) |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Environment API | Vite 6+ multi-environment support, custom runtimes | [environment-api](references/environment-api.md) |\n| Rolldown Migration | Vite 8 changes: Rolldown bundler, Oxc transformer, config migration | [rolldown-migration](references/rolldown-migration.md) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### CLI Commands\n\n```bash\nvite              # Start dev server\nvite build        # Production build\nvite preview      # Preview production build\nvite build --ssr  # SSR build\n```\n\n### Common Config\n\n```ts\nimport { defineConfig } from ''vite''\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [],\n  resolve: { alias: { ''@'': ''/src'' } },\n  server: { port: 3000, proxy: { ''/api'': ''http://localhost:8080'' } },\n  build: { target: ''esnext'', outDir: ''dist'' },\n})\n```\n\n### Official Plugins\n\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue` - Vue 3 SFC support\n- `@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx` - Vue 3 JSX\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react` - React with Oxc/Babel\n- `@vitejs/plugin-react-swc` - React with SWC\n- `@vitejs/plugin-legacy` - Legacy browser support\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:22:38.360Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Development Agents needing optimized build tooling with Rolldown and Oxc integration.","zh":"非常适合需要优化的构建工具和 Rolldown 以及 Oxc 集成的前端开发代理。","ja":"フロントエンド開発エージェントが最適化されたビルドツールと Rolldown および Oxc 統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"롤다운 및 옥스 통합을 통해 최적화된 빌드 도구가 필요한 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo Frontend que necesitan herramientas de compilación optimizadas con Rolldown y Oxc integration.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Frontend ayant besoin d''outils de construction optimisés avec Rolldown et Oxc integration.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die optimierte Build-Tools mit Rolldown und Oxc-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend que necessitam de ferramentas de build otimizadas com integração Rolldown e Oxc.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Frontend Development Agents, которым требуется оптимизированный инструментарий сборки с интеграцией Rolldown и Oxc.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى أدوات بناء محسنة مع تكامل Rolldown و Oxc."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to configure and manage Vite 8 projects with native ESM, HMR support, and Rolldown-powered bundling. Provides TypeScript-first configuration with conditional environment handling through loadEnv.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Vite 8 项目中的本地 ESM、HMR 支持以及 Rolldown 提供的打包功能，提供 TypeScript-first 配置，并通过 loadEnv 处理条件环境。","ja":"Vite 8 プロジェクトでネイティブ ESM、HMR サポート、Rolldown パワードのバンドリングを使用してエージェントを構成および管理できるようにします。loadEnv 経由の条件環境ハンドリングを使用した TypeScript-first 構成を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 네이티브 ESM, HMR 지원 및 롤다운 파워드 번들링을 사용하여 바이트 8 프로젝트를 구성 및 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 로드엔브를 통해 조건부 환경 처리를 사용하는 타입스크립트 첫 번째 구성 제공","es":"Permite a los agentes configurar y administrar proyectos Vite 8 con ESM nativo, soporte HMR y empaquetado con Rolldown. Proporciona configuración de TypeScript con control de entorno condicional a través de loadEnv.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et de gérer des projets Vite 8 avec ESM natif, prise en charge HMR et regroupement alimenté par Rolldown. Fournit une configuration TypeScript avec un contrôle d''environnement conditionnel via loadEnv.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Vite 8-Projekte mit nativem ESM, HMR-Unterstützung und Rolldown-basiertem Bundling zu konfigurieren und zu verwalten. Bietet eine TypeScript-erste Konfiguration mit bedingter Umgebungsverwaltung durch loadEnv.","pt":"Permite que os agentes configurem e gerenciem projetos Vite 8 com ESM nativo, suporte HMR e empacotamento alimentado por Rolldown. Fornece configuração TypeScript-first com tratamento condicional de ambiente através do loadEnv.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать и управлять проектами Vite 8 с нативным ESM, поддержкой HMR и сборкой на основе Rolldown. Обеспечивает конфигурацию TypeScript-first с условной обработкой окружения через loadEnv.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تكوين وإدارة مشاريع Vite 8 مع ESM الأصلي، ودعم HMR، والحزم المدعوم من Rolldown. يوفر تكوين TypeScript-first مع التعامل الشرطي للبيئة عبر loadEnv."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring vite.config.ts with conditional builds","Optimizing production builds with Rolldown bundler","Managing environment variables with loadEnv","Setting up dev server with HMR and native ESM"],"zh":["使用条件构建配置 vite.config.ts","使用 Rolldown 번들러优化生产构建","使用 loadEnv 管理环境变量","使用 HMR 和本地 ESM 设置开发服务器"],"ja":["条件ビルドを使用して vite.config.ts を構成する","Rolldown バンドラーを使用してプロダクション ビルドを最適化する","loadEnv を使用して環境変数を管理する","HMR とネイティブ ESM を使用して開発サーバーを設定する"],"ko":["조건부 빌드를 사용하여 vite.config.ts를 구성하는 것","롤다운 번들러를 사용하여 프로덕션 빌드를 최적화하는 것","로드엔브를 사용하여 환경 변수를 관리하는 것","HMR 및 네이티브 ESM을 사용하여 개발 서버를 설정하는 것"],"es":["Configuración de vite.config.ts con construcciones condicionales","Optimización de compilaciones de producción con empaquetador Rolldown","Administración de variables de entorno con loadEnv","Configuración del servidor de desarrollo con HMR y ESM nativo"],"fr":["Configuration de vite.config.ts avec des builds conditionnels","Optimisation des builds de production avec le bundleur Rolldown","Gestion des variables d''environnement avec loadEnv","Configuration du serveur de développement avec HMR et ESM natif"],"de":["Konfiguration von vite.config.ts mit bedingten Builds","Optimierung von Produktionsbuilds mit Rolldown-Bündler","Verwaltung von Umgebungsvariablen mit loadEnv","Einrichtung des Entwicklungsservers mit HMR und nativem ESM"],"pt":["Configurando vite.config.ts com builds condicionais","Otimizando builds de produção com o empacotador Rolldown","Gerenciando variáveis de ambiente com loadEnv","Configurando servidor de desenvolvimento com HMR e ESM nativo"],"ru":["Настройка vite.config.ts с условными сборками","Оптимизация production builds с помощью сборщика Rolldown","Управление переменными окружения с помощью loadEnv","Настройка dev server с HMR и нативным ESM"],"ar":["تكوين vite.config.ts مع بناء شرطي","تحسين بناء الإنتاج مع حزمة Rolldown","إدارة متغيرات البيئة مع loadEnv","إعداد خادم التطوير مع HMR و ESM الأصلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite 8 beta (Rolldown-powered)","Mandatory ESM usage (no CommonJS)","TypeScript configuration preferred"],"zh":["需要 Vite 8 beta（Rolldown 提供的）","必须使用 ESM（不支持 CommonJS）","首选 TypeScript 配置"],"ja":["Vite 8 ベータ（Rolldown パワード）が必要","ESM の使用が必須（CommonJS はサポートされません）","TypeScript 構成が推奨されます"],"ko":["바이트 8 베타(롤다운 파워드)가 필요함","ESM 사용이 필수(커먼JS 지원 안함)","타입스크립트 구성이 선호됨"],"es":["Requiere Vite 8 beta (con tecnología Rolldown)","Uso obligatorio de ESM (sin CommonJS)","Configuración de TypeScript preferida"],"fr":["Nécessite Vite 8 beta (avec technologie Rolldown)","Utilisation obligatoire de ESM (pas de CommonJS)","Configuration TypeScript préférée"],"de":["Benötigt Vite 8 Beta (mit Rolldown-Technologie)","Verpflichtende Verwendung von ESM (kein CommonJS)","TypeScript-Konfiguration bevorzugt"],"pt":["Requer Vite 8 beta (com suporte a Rolldown)","Uso obrigatório de ESM (sem CommonJS)","Configuração TypeScript preferida"],"ru":["Требуется Vite 8 beta (на основе Rolldown)","Обязательное использование ESM (без CommonJS)","Предпочтительна конфигурация TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب Vite 8 beta (بدعم Rolldown)","استخدام إلزامي لـ ESM (بدون CommonJS)","تفضيل تكوين TypeScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3cb7a75336e338faa9be15dd8b97479721ac8ceac6f1ff4061c9b9eefccd9983","qualityScore":40}');
