against the local PostgreSQL database. Accepts raw SQL or natural language queries that get converted to SQL automatically. Use for inspecting data, running queries, or managing the Kindle notes database."},"features":{"zh":["执行 SQL 查询","管理 Kindle 记事本数据库","检查数据","支持原始 SQL 和自然语言查询","自动将自然语言查询转换为 SQL","适用于开发人员和数据分析师"],"ja":["SQL クエリの実行","Kindle ノートデータベースの管理","データの検査","生の SQL と自然言語クエリのサポート","自然言語クエリを SQL に自動変換","開発者とデータ分析者のためのツール"],"ko":["SQL 쿼리 실행","Kindle 노트 데이터베이스 관리","데이터 검사","원시 SQL 및 자연어 쿼리 지원","자연어 쿼리를 SQL로 자동 변환","개발자 및 데이터 분석자를 위한 도구"],"es":["Ejecuta consultas SQL en bases de datos PostgreSQL","Convierte consultas en lenguaje natural a SQL","Permite la inspección de datos y la gestión de la base de datos","Soporta consultas raw SQL","Es útil para desarrolladores y administradores de bases de datos"],"fr":["Exécute des requêtes SQL sur des bases de données PostgreSQL","Convertis des requêtes en langage naturel en SQL","Permet l''inspection de données et la gestion de la base de données","Prend en charge les requêtes SQL brutes","Est utile pour les développeurs et les administrateurs de bases de données"],"de":["Führt SQL-Abfragen in PostgreSQL-Datenbanken aus","Wandelt Abfragen in natürlicher Sprache in SQL um","Ermöglicht die Untersuchung von Daten und die Verwaltung der Datenbank","Unterstützt raw SQL-Abfragen","Ist nützlich für Entwickler und Datenbankadministratoren"],"pt":["Executa consultas SQL no banco de dados PostgreSQL local","Aceita consultas SQL brutas ou consultas em linguagem natural","Converte consultas em linguagem natural em SQL automaticamente","Permite inspecionar dados e gerenciar bancos de dados","É uma ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Выполняет запросы SQL к локальной базе данных PostgreSQL","Принимает сырые SQL-запросы или запросы в естественном языке","Автоматически преобразует запросы в естественном языке в SQL","Позволяет осматривать данные и управлять базами данных","Это ИИ инструмент для разработчиков"],"ar":["تنفذ استفسارات SQL على قاعدة بيانات PostgreSQL المحلية","تقبل استفسارات SQL النيئة أو استفسارات اللغة الطبيعية","تحول استفسارات اللغة الطبيعية إلى SQL تلقائيًا","تمكن من استكشاف البيانات وإدارة قواعد البيانات","هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["psql AI エイジェント","PostgreSQL 数据库管理","SQL 查询工具","Kindle 记事本数据库管理","数据检查工具","如何使用 psql","psql 教程","PostgreSQL 数据库设置","psql 安装指南"],"ja":["psql AIエージェント","PostgreSQL データベース管理","SQL クエリツール","Kindle ノートデータベース管理","データ検査ツール","psql の使い方","psql チュートリアル","PostgreSQL データベース設定","psql インストールガイド"],"ko":["psql AI 에이전트","PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 관리","SQL 쿼리 도구","Kindle 노트 데이터베이스 관리","데이터 검사 도구","psql 사용법","psql 튜토리얼","PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 설정","psql 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para bases de datos","psql para PostgreSQL","cómo usar psql","qué es psql","alternativas a psql","psql vs SQL","instalación de psql","guía de configuración de psql"],"fr":["outils IA pour bases de données","psql pour PostgreSQL","comment utiliser psql","qu''est-ce que psql","alternatives à psql","psql vs SQL","installation de psql","guide de configuration de psql"],"de":["KI-Tools für Datenbanken","psql für PostgreSQL","wie man psql verwendet","was ist psql","Alternativen zu psql","psql vs SQL","Installation von psql","Konfigurationsanleitung für psql"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","psql","consultas sql","banco de dados postgresql","desenvolvedores","ia para desenvolvedores","como usar psql","o que é psql","psql vs sql"],"ru":["ИИ инструменты","psql","запросы sql","база данных postgresql","разработчики","ИИ для разработчиков","как использовать psql","что такое psql","psql vs sql"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","psql","استفسارات sql","قاعدة بيانات postgresql","المطورون","الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام psql","ما هو psql","psql مقابل sql"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"psql","description":"Execute SQL queries against the local PostgreSQL database. Accepts raw SQL or natural language queries that get converted to SQL automatically. Use for inspecting data, running queries, or managing the Kindle notes database.","bodyPreview":"# PostgreSQL Query Skill\n\nYou are a PostgreSQL database assistant. Your job is to help the user query their local Kindle notes database.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Tool Usage Restrictions\n\n**CRITICAL SECURITY REQUIREMENT:**\n- You may ONLY use the Bash tool to execute `psql` commands\n- ANY other bash command is STRICTLY FORBIDDEN\n- Valid patterns: `psql \"<connection>\" -c \"<query>\"` or `psql <connection> -c \"<query>\"`\n- If the user requests any non-psql command, politely refuse and explain this skill is restr","body":"# PostgreSQL Query Skill\n\nYou are a PostgreSQL database assistant. Your job is to help the user query their local Kindle notes database.\n\n## IMPORTANT: Tool Usage Restrictions\n\n**CRITICAL SECURITY REQUIREMENT:**\n- You may ONLY use the Bash tool to execute `psql` commands\n- ANY other bash command is STRICTLY FORBIDDEN\n- Valid patterns: `psql \"<connection>\" -c \"<query>\"` or `psql <connection> -c \"<query>\"`\n- If the user requests any non-psql command, politely refuse and explain this skill is restricted to database queries only\n- You may use the Read tool ONLY to check for the `.env` file to get `DATABASE_URL`\n\n## Your Task\n\nThe user has provided a query input. You must:\n\n1. **Detect the input type:**\n   - If it looks like raw SQL (starts with SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, WITH, or psql commands like \\d, \\dt, \\l, etc.),  execute it directly\n   - If it''s natural language, convert to SQL first, show the generated query, then execute\n\n2. **Get database connection details:**\n   - Check if `.env` file exists and contains `DATABASE_URL`\n   - If not, use default: `postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/fastapi_db`\n\n3. **For natural language queries:**\n   - First, fetch the database schema by running: `psql <connection> -c \"\\d\"`\n   - Analyze the schema to understand available tables and columns\n   - Generate appropriate SQL query based on the user''s request\n   - Show the generated SQL to the user with an explanation\n   - For write operations (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE), ask for confirmation before executing\n   - For read operations (SELECT), auto-execute\n\n4. **Execute the query:**\n   - Use the `psql` command-line tool with the connection string\n   - Format: `psql \"<DATABASE_URL>\" -c \"<query>\"`\n   - Display results in a readable format\n\n5. **Handle errors gracefully:**\n   - If query fails, show the error message\n   - Suggest corrections if possible\n\n## Database Schema Reference\n\nThe Kindle notes database has these main tables:\n- `books` - Book information (id, title, author, asin, etc.)\n- `notes` - Individual highlights/notes (id, book_id, content, location, etc.)\n- `evaluations` - LLM-generated context evaluations (note_id, score, reasoning, etc.)\n\nNote: Always fetch the actual schema with `\\d` for accurate column names and types.\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n**Direct SQL:**\nUser: `SELECT * FROM books LIMIT 5;`\nYou: Execute directly using psql\n\n**Natural Language:**\nUser: `show me the 5 most recent books`\nYou:\n1. Fetch schema with `\\d`\n2. Generate SQL: `SELECT * FROM books ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 5;`\n3. Show user: \"I''ll run this query: `SELECT * FROM books ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 5;`\"\n4. Execute and display results\n\n**psql Commands:**\nUser: `\\dt`\nYou: Execute `psql \"<DATABASE_URL>\" -c \"\\dt\"` to list tables\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- Always show the user what query you''re running\n- For natural language, explain your SQL reasoning briefly\n- If the user''s request is ambiguous, ask clarifying questions\n- Use the Bash tool to execute psql commands\n- Present results in a clear, formatted way\n- For large result sets, consider adding LIMIT clauses\n\n## Safety\n\n- For destructive operations (DROP, TRUNCATE), always warn and confirm\n- For UPDATE/DELETE without WHERE clauses, strongly warn about affecting all rows\n- Never expose sensitive credentials in output\n\nNow, process the user''s query based on these instructions.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:22:58.785Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced PostgreSQL query capabilities via psql","zh":"非常适合需要高级PostgreSQL查询功能的数据分析代理，通过psql实现","ja":"高度なPostgreSQLクエリ機能を必要とするデータ分析エージェントに最適、psqlを介して","ko":"고급 PostgreSQL 쿼리 기능을 필요한 데이터 분석 에이전트에게 적합, psql을 통해","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de datos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de consulta de PostgreSQL a través de psql","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de données ayant besoin de capacités de requête PostgreSQL avancées via psql","de":"Perfekt für Datenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte PostgreSQL-Abfragefunktionen über psql benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de consulta PostgreSQL via psql","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым требуются расширенные возможности выполнения запросов PostgreSQL через psql","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات استعلام PostgreSQL متقدمة عبر psql"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute SQL queries on local databases using psql commands, providing direct access to PostgreSQL databases for data retrieval and manipulation through the Bash tool, leveraging valid patterns like `psql <connection> -c <query>`","zh":"赋予代理执行SQL查询的能力，通过psql命令在本地数据库中使用Bash工具，直接访问PostgreSQL数据库以检索和操作数据，利用有效的模式，如`psql <connection> -c <query>`","ja":"エージェントに、Bashツールを介してローカルデータベースでSQLクエリを実行する機能を提供し、PostgreSQLデータベースに直接アクセスしてデータを取得および操作する、有効なパターンを利用することができる、例えば`psql <connection> -c <query>`","ko":"에이전트가 Bash 도구를 통해 로컬 데이터베이스에서 SQL 쿼리를 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, PostgreSQL 데이터베이스에 직접 접근하여 데이터를 검색 및 조작할 수 있으며, 유효한 패턴을 활용할 수 있다. 예를 들어 `psql <connection> -c <query>`","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar consultas SQL en bases de datos locales utilizando comandos psql, proporcionando acceso directo a bases de datos PostgreSQL para recuperación y manipulación de datos a través de la herramienta Bash, aprovechando patrones válidos como `psql <connection> -c <query>`","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des requêtes SQL sur des bases de données locales en utilisant des commandes psql, fournissant un accès direct aux bases de données PostgreSQL pour la récupération et la manipulation de données via l''outil Bash, en exploitant des modèles valides comme `psql <connection> -c <query>`","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, SQL-Abfragen auf lokalen Datenbanken mit psql-Befehlen auszuführen, wodurch direkter Zugriff auf PostgreSQL-Datenbanken für Datenabruf und -manipulation über das Bash-Tool ermöglicht wird, indem gültige Muster wie `psql <connection> -c <query>` genutzt werden","pt":"Capacita os agentes a executar consultas SQL em bancos de dados locais usando comandos psql, fornecendo acesso direto a bancos de dados PostgreSQL para recuperação e manipulação de dados através da ferramenta Bash, aproveitando padrões válidos como `psql <connection> -c <query>`","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять SQL-запросы к локальным базам данных с использованием команд psql, обеспечивая прямой доступ к базам данных PostgreSQL для извлечения и манипулирования данными через инструмент Bash, используя допустимые шаблоны, такие как `psql <connection> -c <query>`","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ استعلامات SQL على قواعد البيانات المحلية باستخدام أوامر psql، مما يوفر وصولاً مباشرًا إلى قواعد بيانات PostgreSQL لاسترداد البيانات ومعالجتها من خلال أداة Bash، مستفيدًا من الأنماط الصالحة مثل `psql <connection> -c <query>`"},"useCases":{"en":["Querying local Kindle notes databases","Executing SQL commands securely via Bash","Retrieving specific data from PostgreSQL databases"],"zh":["查询本地Kindle笔记数据库","通过Bash安全地执行SQL命令","从PostgreSQL数据库中检索特定数据"],"ja":["ローカルのKindleノートデータベースを照会する","Bashを介してSQLコマンドを安全に実行する","PostgreSQLデータベースから特定のデータを取得する"],"ko":["로컬 Kindle 노트 데이터베이스 쿼리","Bash를 통해 SQL 명령어를 안전하게 실행","PostgreSQL 데이터베이스에서 특정 데이터를 검색"],"es":["Consultar bases de datos de notas locales de Kindle","Ejecutar comandos SQL de forma segura a través de Bash","Recuperar datos específicos de bases de datos PostgreSQL"],"fr":["Interroger les bases de données de notes Kindle locales","Exécuter des commandes SQL de manière sécurisée via Bash","Récupérer des données spécifiques à partir de bases de données PostgreSQL"],"de":["Abfrage lokaler Kindle-Notizendatenbanken","Sichere Ausführung von SQL-Befehlen über Bash","Abrufen spezifischer Daten aus PostgreSQL-Datenbanken"],"pt":["Consultar bancos de dados de notas Kindle locais","Executar comandos SQL com segurança via Bash","Recuperar dados específicos de bancos de dados PostgreSQL"],"ru":["Выполнение запросов к локальным базам данных заметок Kindle","Безопасное выполнение SQL-команд через Bash","Извлечение конкретных данных из баз данных PostgreSQL"],"ar":["استعلام قواعد بيانات ملاحظات Kindle المحلية","تنفيذ أوامر SQL بأمان عبر Bash","استرداد بيانات محددة من قواعد بيانات PostgreSQL"]},"limitations":{"en":["Strictly limited to psql commands executed through the Bash tool","No support for non-psql Bash commands","Requires proper connection details for database access"],"zh":["仅限通过Bash工具执行的psql命令","不支持非psql的Bash命令","需要正确的连接详细信息以访问数据库"],"ja":["Bashツールを介して実行されるpsqlコマンドにのみ限定される","psql以外のBashコマンドはサポートされない","データベースアクセスには正しい接続詳細が必要"],"ko":["Bash 도구를 통해 실행되는 psql 명령어에만 한정","psql이 아닌 Bash 명령어는 지원되지 않음","데이터베이스 접근을 위해 올바른 연결 세부 정보가 필요"],"es":["Estrictamente limitado a comandos psql ejecutados a través de la herramienta Bash","No admite comandos Bash que no sean psql","Requiere detalles de conexión adecuados para el acceso a la base de datos"],"fr":["Strictement limité aux commandes psql exécutées via l''outil Bash","Aucun support pour les commandes Bash non psql","Nécessite des détails de connexion appropriés pour l''accès à la base de données"],"de":["Streng begrenzt auf psql-Befehle, die über das Bash-Tool ausgeführt werden","Keine Unterstützung für nicht-psql-Bash-Befehle","Erfordert ordnungsgemäße Verbindungsdetails für den Datenbankzugriff"],"pt":["Estritamente limitado a comandos psql executados através da ferramenta Bash","Sem suporte para comandos Bash não-psql","Requer detalhes de conexão adequados para acesso ao banco de dados"],"ru":["Строго ограничено командами psql, выполняемыми через инструмент Bash","Отсутствие поддержки команд Bash, не относящихся к psql","Требует правильных данных подключения для доступа к базе данных"],"ar":["مقصور حصريًا على أوامر psql التي يتم تنفيذها عبر أداة Bash","لا يدعم أوامر Bash غير psql","يتطلب تفاصيل اتصال مناسبة للوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1a297a3a0b3c6041cca2dd254ef9a154995f31a71cf32061b847e48cec345c23","qualityScore":40}');
