نشاء وصفات مشكلة وطلب سحب متوافقة مع أفضل الممارسات وقوالب المستودع مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"definition":{"en":"prepare-issue-pr is a skill that automatically prepares comprehensive and well-structured Issue and Pull Request descriptions","zh":"prepare-issue-pr 是一个自动化工具，用于创建问题和拉取请求描述","ja":"prepare-issue-pr は、Issue/PR 説明の自動化ツールです","ko":"prepare-issue-pr는 이슈 및 풀 리クエ스트 설명을 자동으로 생성하는 도구입니다","es":"Prepare-issue-pr es una herramienta de preparación de Issue y Pull Request que automatiza la detección de tipo y la creación de descripciones estructuradas","fr":"Prepare-issue-pr est un outil de préparation de Issue et Pull Request qui automatise la détection de type et la création de descriptions structurées","de":"Prepare-issue-pr ist ein Tool zur Vorbereitung von Issue und Pull Request, das die Typenerkennung und die Erstellung strukturierter Beschreibungen automatisiert","pt":"O prepare-issue-pr é uma ferramenta de preparação de Issue e Pull Request que utiliza detecção de tipo e indicadores para criar descrições bem estruturadas","ru":"Prepare-issue-pr - это инструмент подготовки Issue и Pull Request, который использует обнаружение типа и индикаторы для создания описаний","ar":"prepare-issue-pr هو أداة إعداد مشكلة وطلب سحب تستخدم الكشف عن النوع والمؤشرات لإنشاء وصفات متوافقة"},"features":{"en":["Automatically determines whether to prepare an Issue or Pull Request based on context","Detects Issue indicators such as ''issue'', ''bug report'', and ''feature request''","Detects PR indicators such as ''PR'', ''pull request'', and ''プルリク''","Generates descriptions that strictly adhere to repository templates and best practices","Supports multiple languages, including English and Japanese"],"zh":["自动检测问题和拉取请求类型","严格遵循仓库模板和最佳实践","支持多种问题和拉取请求指标","自动创建全面的问题和拉取请求描述"],"ja":["Issue/PR のタイプを自動的に検出","リポジトリ テンプレートとベスト プラクティスに厳密に従う","複数の Issue/PR インディケータをサポート","包括的で構造化された Issue/PR 説明を自動的に作成"],"ko":["이슈 및 풀 리ク에스트 유형 자동 감지","저장소 템플릿 및 최선의 관행을 엄격히 따름","다양한 이슈 및 풀 리ク에스트 지표 지원","포괄적이고 구조화된 이슈/PR 설명 자동 생성"],"es":["Detección automática de tipo de Issue o Pull Request","Creación de descripciones estructuradas según plantillas del repositorio","Soporte para indicadores de Issue y PR personalizados","Compatibilidad con tecnologías como CLI y GitHub"],"fr":["Détection automatique du type de Issue ou Pull Request","Création de descriptions structurées selon les modèles de référentiel","Prise en charge d''indicateurs de Issue et PR personnalisés","Compatibilité avec des technologies comme CLI et GitHub"],"de":["Automatische Erkennung von Issue- oder Pull-Request-Typ","Erstellung strukturierter Beschreibungen nach Repository-Vorlagen","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Issue- und PR-Indikatoren","Kompatibilität mit Technologien wie CLI und GitHub"],"pt":["Detecção de tipo automática para Issue e Pull Request","Uso de indicadores de Issue e PR para determinar o tipo de descrição","Criação de descrições bem estruturadas e que seguem as melhores práticas de repositório","Suporte a múltiplos indicadores de Issue e PR","Integração com tecnologias de repositório para garantir a conformidade"],"ru":["Автоматическое обнаружение типа для Issue и Pull Request","Использование индикаторов Issue и PR для определения типа описания","Создание описаний, которые соответствуют шаблонам и лучшим практикам репозитория","Поддержка множества индикаторов Issue и PR","Интеграция с технологиями репозитория для обеспечения соответствия"],"ar":["الكشف التلقائي عن النوع للمشكلة وطلب السحب","استخدام مؤشرات المشكلة وطلب السحب لتحديد نوع الوصف","إنشاء وصفات متوافقة مع قوالب المستودع وأفضل الممارسات","دعم مؤشرات متعددة للمشكلة وطلب السحب","التكامل مع تقنيات المستودع لضمان التوافق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use prepare-issue-pr","prepare-issue-pr setup guide","prepare-issue-pr alternative","prepare-issue-pr vs GitHub templates","automated issue and pr setup","repository template best practices","prepare-issue-pr install","prepare-issue-pr for AI agents"],"zh":["prepare-issue-pr","自动化问题和拉取请求","仓库模板","最佳实践","AIエージェント","自动化工具"],"ja":["prepare-issue-pr","Issue/PR 自動化","リポジトリ テンプレート","ベスト プラクティス","AIエージェント","自動化ツール"],"ko":["prepare-issue-pr","이슈 및 풀 리ク에스트 자동화","저장소 템플릿","최선의 관행","AI 에이전트","자동화 도구"],"es":["herramientas de Issue","herramientas de Pull Request","preparación de Issue","preparación de Pull Request","automatización de Issue","automatización de Pull Request","CLI","GitHub","Herramientas de desarrollo de software"],"fr":["outils de Issue","outils de Pull Request","préparation de Issue","préparation de Pull Request","automatisation de Issue","automatisation de Pull Request","CLI","GitHub","Outils de développement de logiciels"],"de":["Issue-Tools","Pull-Request-Tools","Issue-Vorbereitung","Pull-Request-Vorbereitung","Automatisierung von Issue","Automatisierung von Pull Request","CLI","GitHub","Software-Entwicklungs-Tools"],"pt":["prepare-issue-pr","descrição de Issue","descrição de Pull Request","detecção de tipo","indicadores de Issue","indicadores de PR","melhores práticas de repositório","ferramenta de preparação de Issue e Pull Request"],"ru":["prepare-issue-pr","описание Issue","описание Pull Request","обнаружение типа","индикаторы Issue","индикаторы PR","лучшие практики репозитория","инструмент подготовки Issue и Pull Request"],"ar":["prepare-issue-pr","وصف المشكلة","وصف طلب السحب","الكشف عن النوع","مؤشرات المشكلة","مؤشرات طلب السحب","أفضل الممارسات للمستودع","أداة إعداد مشكلة وطلب سحب"]}},"owner":"sushichan044","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"sushichan044/dotfiles","stars":15,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T09:00:09Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prepare-issue-pr","description":"Prepare comprehensive Issue or Pull Request descriptions using repository templates. Automatically detects type, finds appropriate templates, and guides users through filling them out completely. Use when users want to create Issues or PRs.","bodyPreview":"You are an Issue/PR Preparation Specialist, an expert in creating comprehensive and well-structured Issue and Pull Request descriptions that strictly adhere to repository templates and best practices.\n\nYour primary responsibilities:\n\n1. **Type Detection**: Automatically determine whether to prepare an Issue or Pull Request based on context:\n   - **Issue indicators**: \"issue\", \"イシュー\", \"報告\", \"提案\", \"feature request\", \"bug report\", \"問題\", etc.\n   - **PR indicators**: \"PR\", \"pull request\", \"プルリク\", \"マー","body":"You are an Issue/PR Preparation Specialist, an expert in creating comprehensive and well-structured Issue and Pull Request descriptions that strictly adhere to repository templates and best practices.\n\nYour primary responsibilities:\n\n1. **Type Detection**: Automatically determine whether to prepare an Issue or Pull Request based on context:\n   - **Issue indicators**: \"issue\", \"イシュー\", \"報告\", \"提案\", \"feature request\", \"bug report\", \"問題\", etc.\n   - **PR indicators**: \"PR\", \"pull request\", \"プルリク\", \"マージ\", \"review\", \"レビュー\", \"実装した\", \"finished implementing\", etc.\n   - If unclear from context, ask the user which type they need\n   - Consider git status: if there are uncommitted changes or commits to push, likely a PR; otherwise, likely an Issue\n\n2. **Template Discovery**: Search for templates based on the detected type:\n   - **For Pull Requests**: `fd -H -e md --ignore-case -p ''pull_request_template''`\n   - **For Issues**: `fd -H -e md --ignore-case -p ''issue_template''`\n   - Combine results from both Issue search methods\n\n3. **Template Selection Process**:\n   - If multiple templates are found, present them to the user with clear descriptions and let them choose\n   - If only one template is found, proceed automatically with that template\n   - If no templates are found, inform the user and offer to create a basic PR structure\n\n4. **Template Adherence (CRITICAL)**:\n   - Read the selected template completely and understand every section and requirement\n   - NEVER delete or modify any existing content in the template\n   - Fill out every section that the template requires\n   - Preserve all formatting, checkboxes, and structural elements exactly as they appear\n   - If a section is optional or not applicable, clearly mark it as such rather than removing it\n\n5. **Content Generation**:\n   - **For Pull Requests**:\n     - Use `git --no-pager diff-ancestor-commit` to analyze the changes being made\n     - Include both \"What\" (problem solved, feature added) and implementation details\n     - Reference specific code changes, files modified, and technical decisions\n   - **For Issues**:\n     - DO NOT use git diff commands\n     - Focus on \"What\" (problem statement, desired outcome) and \"Why\" (motivation, impact)\n     - Emphasize user-facing needs, business value, and problem context\n     - Avoid implementation details - that belongs in the PR\n   - **For Both**:\n     - Detect the primary language of the template and write in that language (default to English if unclear)\n     - Provide comprehensive answers to all template questions\n\n6. **Title Generation**:\n   - **For Pull Requests**:\n     - Create a clear, concise title that describes WHAT the PR accomplishes\n     - Focus on the problem solved or feature added, not HOW it was implemented\n     - Follow conventional commit format if the repository uses it\n   - **For Issues**:\n     - Create a clear title that describes the problem or desired feature\n     - Focus on user-facing impact and business value\n     - Use action-oriented language (e.g., \"Add\", \"Fix\", \"Support\", \"Improve\")\n   - **For Both**:\n     - Provide 2-3 title options for the user to choose from\n\n7. **Quality Assurance**:\n   - Ensure all required sections are completed\n   - Verify that the description clearly explains the purpose and impact of changes\n   - Check that any checklists in the template are properly addressed\n   - Confirm that the language and tone match the template''s style\n\n**Workflow**:\n\n1. Detect whether preparing an Issue or Pull Request from context\n2. Search for appropriate templates using the specified fd commands\n3. Present options to user if multiple templates exist\n4. Analyze the selected template thoroughly\n5. Gather information:\n   - **For PR**: Use git commands to analyze changes\n   - **For Issue**: Focus on problem understanding and user needs\n6. Fill out the template completely without removing any existing content\n7. Generate appropriate title suggestions (2-3 options)\n8. Present the completed description and title options to the user\n9. Save the results to a gitignored memo file using the memo command for future reference\n\n**Important Notes**:\n\n- Always preserve the original template structure and content\n- Be thorough in filling out all sections - incomplete templates are not acceptable\n- When in doubt about language, default to English\n- **For PRs**: Focus on both problem resolution and implementation approach; use git commands\n- **For Issues**: Focus on problem statement, motivation, and desired outcomes; avoid implementation details\n- Title should clearly communicate value to readers unfamiliar with the context\n\n**Final Output Process**:\n\nAfter completing the Issue/PR description and title generation:\n\n1. Create a memo file using:\n   - **For PR**: `sidetable memo draft-pr`\n   - **For Issue**: `sidetable memo draft-issue`\n   - Note: This command creates the file to write the results to\n\n2. Write the results to the memo file in the appropriate format:\n\n**For Pull Requests**:\n\n```markdown\n# PR Generation Complete\n\n## PR Title Candidates\n\n1. [Option 1]\n2. [Option 2]\n3. [Option 3]\n\n## Final PR Description\n\n[Complete PR description with all template sections filled]\n\n## Analysis Summary\n\n- Primary changes: [brief summary]\n- Files modified: [count and key files]\n- Impact area: [affected components/features]\n```\n\n**For Issues**:\n\n```markdown\n# Issue Generation Complete\n\n## Issue Title Candidates\n\n1. [Option 1]\n2. [Option 2]\n3. [Option 3]\n\n## Final Issue Description\n\n[Complete Issue description with all template sections filled]\n\n## Problem Summary\n\n- Problem statement: [brief summary]\n- Motivation: [why this matters]\n- Expected impact: [who benefits and how]\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:51:20.317Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated Issue and Pull Request preparation with adherence to repository templates and best practices.","zh":"适用于需要自动化问题和拉取请求准备并遵守仓库模板和最佳实践的开发代理。","ja":"リポジトリ テンプレートとベスト プラクティスに従った問題とプル リクエストの準備の自動化を必要とする開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"저장소 템플릿과 모범 사례를 준수하는 문제와 풀 요청 준비의 자동화를 필요로 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren preparación automatizada de problemas y solicitudes de extracción con adherencia a plantillas de repositorio y mejores prácticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une préparation automatisée des problèmes et des demandes de tirage avec adhésion aux modèles de référentiel et aux meilleures pratiques.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Vorbereitung von Problemen und Pull-Anfragen mit Einhaltung von Repository-Vorlagen und Best Practices erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem preparação automatizada de Problemas e Solicitações de Pull com aderência a modelos de repositório e melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированной подготовки проблемы и запроса на вытягивание с соблюдением шаблонов репозитория и лучших практик.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب تحضيرًا 자동يًا للقضايا وطلبات السحب مع الالتزام bằng قوالب المستودع وأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Issue and Pull Request preparation, utilizing type detection based on context indicators such as ''issue'', ''bug report'', and ''pull request'', and adhering to repository templates for comprehensive and well-structured descriptions.","zh":"赋予代理人自动化问题和拉取请求准备的能力，利用基于上下文指标（如 ''问题''、''错误报告'' 和 ''拉取请求''）的类型检测，并遵守仓库模板以生成全面且结构良好的描述。","ja":"エージェントに問題とプル リクエストの準備の自動化を可能にし、上下文指標（例: ''問題''、''バグ報告''、''プル リクエスト''）に基づく型検出を使用し、リポジトリ テンプレートに従って包括的で構造化された説明を生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 자동으로 문제와 풀 요청 준비를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, ''문제'', ''버그 보고'', ''풀 요청''과 같은 문맥 지시자를 기반으로 하는 유형 감지를 사용하여 저장소 템플릿을 준수하여 종합적이고 구조화된 설명을 생성합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar la preparación de problemas y solicitudes de extracción, utilizando la detección de tipo basada en indicadores de contexto como ''problema'', ''informe de errores'' y ''solicitud de extracción'', y ajustándose a las plantillas del repositorio para descripciones completas y bien estructuradas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la préparation des problèmes et des demandes de tirage, en utilisant la détection de type basée sur des indicateurs de contexte tels que ''problème'', ''rapport de bogue'' et ''demande de tirage'', et en s''adaptant aux modèles de référentiel pour des descriptions complètes et bien structurées.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Vorbereitung von Problemen und Pull-Anfragen zu automatisieren, indem sie die Typenerkennung auf der Grundlage von Kontextindikatoren wie ''Problem'', ''Fehlerbericht'' und ''Pull-Anfrage'' nutzen und sich an die Repository-Vorlagen für umfassende und gut strukturierte Beschreibungen anpassen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a preparação de Problemas e Solicitações de Pull, utilizando detecção de tipo com base em indicadores de contexto como ''problema'', ''relatório de bug'' e ''solicitação de pull'', e aderindo a modelos de repositório para descrições abrangentes e bem estruturadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать подготовку проблемы и запроса на вытягивание, используя обнаружение типа на основе контекстных индикаторов, таких как ''проблема'', ''отчет о баге'' и ''запрос на вытягивание'', и соблюдая шаблоны репозитория для полных и хорошо структурированных описаний.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تحضير قوائم المشاكل وطلبات السحب تلقائيًا، باستخدام اكتشاف النوع على أساس مؤشرات السياق مثل ''المشكلة'' و ''تقرير الخطأ'' و ''طلب السحب''، والامتثال لقوالب المستودع لوصف شامل ومنظم جيدًا."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Issue preparation based on bug reports and feature requests","Generating Pull Requests with detailed descriptions and repository template adherence","Streamlining development workflows by automatically determining whether to prepare an Issue or Pull Request"],"zh":["基于错误报告和功能请求自动化问题准备","生成详细描述和仓库模板遵从性的拉取请求","通过自动确定是否准备问题或拉取请求来简化开发工作流"],"ja":["バグ報告と機能要求に基づいた問題の準備の自動化","詳細な説明とリポジトリ テンプレートの遵守性を持つプル リクエストの生成","問題またはプル リクエストの準備の自動化によって開発ワークフローを合理化"],"ko":["버그 보고서와 기능 요청을 기반으로 문제 준비 자동화","상세한 설명과 저장소 템플릿을 준수하는 풀 요청 생성","문제 또는 풀 요청 준비를 자동으로 결정함으로써 개발 워크플ロー 단순화"],"es":["Automatización de la preparación de problemas en función de informes de errores y solicitudes de características","Generación de solicitudes de extracción con descripciones detalladas y adherencia a plantillas de repositorio","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de desarrollo mediante la determinación automática de si se debe preparar un problema o una solicitud de extracción"],"fr":["Automatisation de la préparation des problèmes en fonction de rapports de bogue et de demandes de fonctionnalités","Génération de demandes de tirage avec des descriptions détaillées et une adhésion aux modèles de référentiel","Optimisation des flux de travail de développement en déterminant automatiquement s''il faut préparer un problème ou une demande de tirage"],"de":["Automatisierung der Vorbereitung von Problemen auf der Grundlage von Fehlerberichten und Funktionsanforderungen","Erzeugung von Pull-Anfragen mit detaillierten Beschreibungen und Einhaltung von Repository-Vorlagen","Optimierung von Entwicklungswerkflüssen durch automatische Bestimmung, ob ein Problem oder eine Pull-Anfrage vorbereitet werden soll"],"pt":["Automatizar a preparação de Problemas com base em relatórios de bug e solicitações de recursos","Gerar Solicitações de Pull com descrições detalhadas e aderência a modelos de repositório","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento, determinando automaticamente se preparar um Problema ou uma Solicitação de Pull"],"ru":["Автоматизировать подготовку проблемы на основе отчетов о багах и запросов на функции","Генерировать запросы на вытягивание с подробными описаниями и соблюдением шаблонов репозитория","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы разработки, автоматически определяя, подготовить проблему или запрос на вытягивание"],"ar":["تحضير قوائم المشاكل تلقائيًا على أساس تقارير الأخطاء وطلبات الميزات","توليد طلبات السحب مع وصف مفصل والامتثال لقوالب المستودع","تحسين تدفقات العمل التطويرية، من خلال تحديد تلقائي ما إذا كان يجب تحضير قائمة مشكلة أو طلب سحب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to repository templates and best practices","Limited to text-based input for type detection and Issue/PR description generation","Dependent on accurate context indicators for correct Issue or Pull Request preparation"],"zh":["需要访问仓库模板和最佳实践","仅限基于文本的输入用于类型检测和问题/PR 描述生成","依赖于准确的上下文指标以正确准备问题或拉取请求"],"ja":["リポジトリ テンプレートとベスト プラクティスへのアクセスが必要","型検出と問題/PR 説明の生成にはテキストベースの入力のみが可能","正しい問題またはプル リクエストの準備には正確な上下文指標に依存"],"ko":["저장소 템플릿 및 모범 사례에 대한 액세스가 필요","유형 감지 및 문제/PR 설명 생성을 위한 텍스트 기반 입력만 가능","올바른 문제 또는 풀 요청 준비는 정확한 문맥 지시자에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a plantillas de repositorio y mejores prácticas","Limitado a la entrada de texto para la detección de tipo y la generación de descripciones de problemas/solicitudes de extracción","Dependiente de indicadores de contexto precisos para la preparación correcta de problemas o solicitudes de extracción"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux modèles de référentiel et aux meilleures pratiques","Limité à l''entrée de texte pour la détection de type et la génération de descriptions de problèmes/demandes de tirage","Dépendant d''indicateurs de contexte précis pour la préparation correcte des problèmes ou des demandes de tirage"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Repository-Vorlagen und Best Practices","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Eingabe für die Typenerkennung und die Erzeugung von Problembeschreibungen/Pull-Anfragen","Abhängig von genauen Kontextindikatoren für die korrekte Vorbereitung von Problemen oder Pull-Anfragen"],"pt":["Exige acesso a modelos de repositório e melhores práticas","Limitado a entrada baseada em texto para detecção de tipo e geração de descrição de Problema/PR","Dependente de indicadores de contexto precisos para preparação correta de Problema ou Solicitação de Pull"],"ru":["Требует доступа к шаблонам репозитория и лучшим практикам","Ограничен текстовым вводом для обнаружения типа и генерации описания проблемы/PR","Зависит от точных контекстных индикаторов для правильной подготовки проблемы или запроса на вытягивание"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قوالب المستودع وأفضل الممارسات","محدود بالمدخلات النصية لاكتشاف النوع وتوليد وصف قائمة المشكلة / طلب السحب","يعتمد على مؤشرات السياق الدقيقة لتحضير قائمة مشكلة أو طلب سحب صحيح"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"cd2121072b718c922a70b623c02cb3685d7aff29738fbc6050b1b5f162eeb0b1","qualityScore":39}');
