sthetik von KI-Tools","Verwendet die Schriftart Moderat mit Inter als Fallback-Schriftart","Integriert warme Orangefarben-Verläufe anstelle von Lila/Blau-Verläufen","Folgt dem etablierten Designsystem von BIM Verdi","Generiert benutzerdefinierten Frontend-Code","Integriert mit dem Design-Tool von BIM Verdi"],"pt":["Geração de código de frontend personalizado para BIM Verdi","Evita estéticas genéricas de IA com o uso de fontes personalizadas, como Moderat","Substitui gradientes genéricos por cores quentes, como laranja","Segue o sistema de design estabelecido para BIM Verdi","Permite a personalização do frontend com tecnologias como React e CLI"],"ru":["Генерация персонализированного фронтенда для BIM Verdi","Избегает общих ошибок ИИ Агентов с помощью кастомных шрифтов, таких как Moderat","Заменяет общие градиенты на теплые цвета, такие как оранжевый","Следует установленной системе дизайна для BIM Verdi","Позволяет персонализировать фронтенд с помощью технологий, таких как React и CLI"],"ar":["توليد رمز واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة ل بيم فيردي","تجنب الجماليات العامة لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام خطوط مخصصة، مثل مودرات","استبدال التدرجات العامة بألوان دافئة، مثل البرتقالي","اتباع نظام التصميم المحدد ل بيم فيردي","تمكين-personalize واجهة المستخدم الأمامية باستخدام تقنيات مثل React و CLI"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use bimverdi-design","bimverdi-design alternative","bimverdi-design setup guide","what is bimverdi-design","bimverdi-design vs generic AI design","bimverdi-design install","custom frontend code generation for BIM Verdi","bimverdi-design benefits for developers","bimverdi-design design system"],"zh":["BIM Verdi 设计技能","前端代码生成","设计系统","AI 默认样式","Moderat 字体","温暖的橙色"],"ja":["BIM Verdi デザインスキル","フロントエンドコード生成","設計システム","AI エージェント","Moderat フォント","ウォームオレンジ"],"ko":["BIM Verdi 디자인 스킬","프론트엔드 코드 생성","디자인 시스템","AI 기본 스타일","Moderat 글꼴","따뜻한 오렌지"],"es":["bimverdi-design","desarrollo frontend","sistema de diseño","estética de la IA","codegen","BIM Verdi","desarrollo de software","herramientas de diseño","generación de código"],"fr":["bimverdi-design","développement frontend","système de conception","esthétique de l''IA","codegen","BIM Verdi","développement de logiciels","outils de conception","génération de code"],"de":["bimverdi-design","Frontend-Entwicklung","Designsystem","Ästhetik von KI-Tools","CodeGen","BIM Verdi","Software-Entwicklung","Design-Tools","Code-Generierung"],"pt":["bimverdi-design","desenvolvimento de frontend","IA personalizada","sistema de design","Moderat","React","CLI","frontend personalizado","estéticas de IA"],"ru":["bimverdi-design","создание фронтенда","ИИ Агенты","система дизайна","Moderat","React","CLI","персонализированный фронтенд","ошибки ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["بيم فيردي ديزاين","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","نظام التصميم","مودرات","ري액ت","CLI","واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة","الجماليات العامة لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"aharstad91","repo":"bimverdi-v2","repoPath":"aharstad91/bimverdi-v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T11:04:27Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bimverdi-design","description":"Generate BIM Verdi UI components and pages following the established design system. Use when building templates, components, or any frontend for bimverdi.no. Enforces enterprise-calm aesthetics and avoids generic AI patterns.","bodyPreview":"# BIM Verdi Design Skill\n\nThis skill generates frontend code for BIM Verdi (bimverdi.no) that follows the established design system and avoids generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics.\n\n## Anti-Pattern Awareness\n\nLLMs naturally converge toward high-probability outputs. In frontend design, this creates generic results. **Avoid these AI defaults:**\n\n| AI Default | BIM Verdi Instead |\n|------------|-------------------|\n| Inter font everywhere | Moderat (fallback: Inter) |\n| Purple/blue gradients | Warm orange","body":"# BIM Verdi Design Skill\n\nThis skill generates frontend code for BIM Verdi (bimverdi.no) that follows the established design system and avoids generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics.\n\n## Anti-Pattern Awareness\n\nLLMs naturally converge toward high-probability outputs. In frontend design, this creates generic results. **Avoid these AI defaults:**\n\n| AI Default | BIM Verdi Instead |\n|------------|-------------------|\n| Inter font everywhere | Moderat (fallback: Inter) |\n| Purple/blue gradients | Warm orange #FF8B5E accent |\n| Cards with shadows everywhere | Borderless sections + dividers |\n| Rounded corners (16px+) | Subtle radius (8px buttons, 12px cards) |\n| Heavy drop shadows | No shadows or very subtle |\n| Hover on containers | Hover ONLY on interactive elements |\n| Generic placeholder text | Real Norwegian content |\n\n## Design Philosophy\n\n**Variant B: Dividers & Whitespace** is the standard.\n\nCore principles:\n- **P1:** Whitespace + hairline dividers are primary structure (not boxes)\n- **P2:** Only buttons, links, menu items are clickable\n- **P3:** Information = borderless sections; Actions = buttons/links\n- **P4:** Never show empty fields (hide or show \"Ikke oppgitt\")\n- **P5:** Calm, consistent enterprise style (minimal visual noise)\n\n## Color Palette\n\n```css\n/* Primary */\n--color-primary: #FF8B5E;        /* Warm orange - main accent */\n--color-primary-dark: #E67A4E;\n--color-primary-light: #FFBFA8;\n\n/* Neutrals */\n--color-black: #1A1A1A;          /* Primary text */\n--color-gray-dark: #383838;\n--color-gray-medium: #888888;\n--color-gray-light: #D1D1D1;\n--color-white: #FFFFFF;\n\n/* Backgrounds */\n--color-beige: #F7F5EF;          /* Warm off-white */\n--color-beige-dark: #EFE9DE;\nbody background: #FAFAF8;\n\n/* State */\n--color-success: #B3DB87;\n--color-error: #772015;\n--color-alert: #FFC845;\n--color-info: #005898;\n```\n\n**Usage rules:**\n- Primary orange: CTA buttons, active states, important links\n- Never introduce new accent colors without explicit decision\n- Text is always #1A1A1A or #383838\n- Backgrounds are warm (beige family), never pure white or gray\n\n## Typography\n\n**Font stack:** `''Moderat'', ''Inter'', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif`\n\n| Element | Size | Weight | Line Height |\n|---------|------|--------|-------------|\n| H1 | 3rem (48px) | 700 | 1.2 |\n| H2 | 2rem (32px) | 700 | 1.2 |\n| H3 | 1.5rem (24px) | 600 | 1.2 |\n| H4 | 1.25rem (20px) | 600 | 1.2 |\n| Body | 1rem (16px) | 400 | 1.5-1.75 |\n| Small | 0.875rem (14px) | 400 | 1.5 |\n\n**Rules:**\n- No ALL CAPS except sparingly for labels/overlines\n- Semantic heading order (H1 -> H2 -> H3)\n- Good line height for readability\n\n## Spacing System\n\n8px base scale: `4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64`\n\n```css\n--spacing-xs: 0.5rem;   /* 8px */\n--spacing-sm: 1rem;     /* 16px */\n--spacing-md: 1.5rem;   /* 24px */\n--spacing-lg: 2rem;     /* 32px */\n--spacing-xl: 3rem;     /* 48px */\n--spacing-2xl: 4rem;    /* 64px */\n```\n\n**Use few, consistent spacing values per page.**\n\n## Layout Widths\n\n| Context | Max Width |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Standard content | 1200-1280px |\n| Forms/flows | 960px |\n| Side gutters | Consistent, responsive |\n\n## Buttons\n\n**Standard button:** 36px height, 8px radius, Inter Medium 14px\n\n```html\n<!-- Primary (filled black) -->\n<a href=\"#\" class=\"bv-btn bv-btn--primary\">\n  <span class=\"bv-btn__text\">Lagre</span>\n</a>\n\n<!-- Secondary (outline) -->\n<a href=\"#\" class=\"bv-btn bv-btn--secondary\">\n  <span class=\"bv-btn__text\">Avbryt</span>\n</a>\n\n<!-- Tertiary (ghost) -->\n<a href=\"#\" class=\"bv-btn bv-btn--tertiary\">\n  <span class=\"bv-btn__text\">Se mer</span>\n</a>\n\n<!-- With icon -->\n<a href=\"#\" class=\"bv-btn bv-btn--primary\">\n  <span class=\"bv-btn__icon\">[lucide-icon]</span>\n  <span class=\"bv-btn__text\">Nytt verktoy</span>\n</a>\n```\n\n**Sizes:** `--small` (28px), `--medium` (36px), `--large` (44px)\n\n## Icons\n\n**Framework:** Lucide Icons (https://lucide.dev)\n\n| Icon | Usage |\n|------|-------|\n| `layout-dashboard` | Dashboard |\n| `wrench` | Verktoy |\n| `file-text` | Artikler |\n| `lightbulb` | Prosjektideer |\n| `calendar` | Arrangementer |\n| `user` | Brukerprofil |\n| `building-2` | Bedrift/Foretak |\n| `chevron-right` | Navigate |\n| `plus` | Add new |\n| `pencil` | Edit |\n| `trash-2` | Delete |\n\n**Sizes:** 16px (small), 20px (medium), 24px (large)\n\n## Containers & Sections\n\n**Default:** Borderless sections with dividers\n\n```html\n<!-- Standard section -->\n<section class=\"bv-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"bv-section__title\">Oversikt</h2>\n  <p class=\"bv-section__helper\">Valgfri hjelpetekst</p>\n  <div class=\"bv-section__content\">\n    <!-- Content here -->\n  </div>\n</section>\n<hr class=\"bv-divider\">\n```\n\n**Soft panels** (rare, only for action groups):\n- No shadow\n- Subtle background (#F7F5EF) or hairline border\n- Never hoverable\n\n## Cards\n\n**Cards are NOT clickable** unless explicitly designed with:\n1. Explicit \"Se detaljer\" link + chevron\n2. Defined hover/focus states\n3. Documented as exception\n\n```html\n<!-- Non-clickable info card -->\n<div class=\"bv-card\">\n  <div class=\"bv-card__header\">\n    <h3 class=\"bv-card__title\">Tittel</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bv-card__body\">\n    <p>Innhold</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bv-card__footer\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"bv-btn bv-btn--tertiary\">\n      Se detaljer\n      <span class=\"bv-btn__icon\">[chevron-right]</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Dividers\n\nHairline divider: 1px, low contrast (#E5E5E5 or similar)\n\n```html\n<hr class=\"bv-divider\">\n```\n\n## Forms\n\n**Layout:** 960px max-width, centered\n\n```html\n<div class=\"bv-form-layout\">\n  <div class=\"bv-form-section\">\n    <h3>Seksjonstittel</h3>\n    <div class=\"bv-form-group\">\n      <label for=\"field\">Feltnavn</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"field\" name=\"field\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <hr class=\"bv-divider\">\n  <!-- More sections -->\n</div>\n```\n\n**Sticky actions bar:**\n```html\n<div class=\"bv-form-actions bv-form-actions--sticky\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"bv-btn bv-btn--tertiary\">Avbryt</a>\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"bv-btn bv-btn--secondary\">Lagre som kladd</a>\n  <button type=\"submit\" class=\"bv-btn bv-btn--primary\">Lagre</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Page Templates\n\n### Archive page (e.g., /deltakere/)\n```\nPageHeader: Title + count + primary action button\n|\nFilter/search (if applicable)\n|\nGrid/List of items\n|\nPagination\n```\n\n### Single page (e.g., /deltakere/firmanavn/)\n```\nBreadcrumb\n|\nPageHeader: Title + actions (Edit, etc.)\n|\nTwo-column layout:\n  Left: Borderless sections (Oversikt, Detaljer)\n  Right: Aside blocks (Status, Snarveier)\n```\n\n### Form page (e.g., /min-side/nytt-verktoy/)\n```\nBreadcrumb\n|\nPageHeader: Title + helper text\n|\n960px form layout with sections + dividers\n|\nSticky action bar\n```\n\n## Interaction Rules\n\n**Clickable elements MUST be:**\n- `<button>` or button component\n- `<a>` or link component\n- Menu item\n- Explicit row action with icon + label\n\n**Hover states:**\n- ONLY on interactive elements\n- Links: underline on hover\n- Buttons: background change\n- Containers: NEVER hover\n\n**Focus states:**\n- Always visible (outline/ring)\n- WCAG AA compliant\n\n## WordPress/PHP Context\n\nThis is a WordPress theme. Use:\n- PHP for templates (`single-foretak.php`, `archive-foretak.php`)\n- ACF fields for custom data\n- Existing CSS classes from design-system.php\n- Lucide icons as inline SVG\n\n**Template structure:**\n```php\n<?php get_header(); ?>\n\n<main class=\"bv-main\">\n  <div class=\"bv-container\">\n    <!-- Page content -->\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<?php get_footer(); ?>\n```\n\n## Checklist Before Generating\n\nWhen generating UI code, verify:\n\n- [ ] Using existing CSS classes from design-system.php\n- [ ] Following Variant B (dividers/whitespace, not boxes)\n- [ ] Containers are NOT clickable\n- [ ] Only interactive elements have hover/pointer\n- [ ] Empty fields hidden or show \"Ikke oppgitt\"\n- [ ] Layout widths: 1200-1280 standard, 960 for forms\n- [ ] Spacing on 8px scale\n- [ ] Colors from palette only\n- [ ] Lucide icons only\n- [ ] Norwegian text (not lorem ipsum)\n- [ ] Semantic HTML (proper headings, buttons vs links)\n- [ ] Accessible (labels, focus states, contrast)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:41:41.555Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring custom BIM Verdi design elements and unique branding features like Moderat font and warm orange gradients.","zh":"适合需要自定义BIM Verdi设计元素和独特品牌特征（如Moderat字体和暖橙色渐变）的前端代理。","ja":"カスタムBIM Verdiデザイン要素やModeratフォント、ウォームオレンジグラデーションなどの独自のブランド機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"사용자 지정 BIM Verdi 디자인 요소 및 고유한 브랜드 기능(예: Moderat 글꼴 및 따뜻한 오렌지 그라데이션)이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren elementos de diseño personalizados de BIM Verdi y características de marca única como la fuente Moderat y degradados naranjas cálidos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant des éléments de conception personnalisés de BIM Verdi et des fonctionnalités de marque unique comme la police Moderat et les dégradés orange chauds.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte BIM Verdi-Desigenelemente und einzigartige Markenmerkmale wie die Moderat-Schrift und warme Orangefarbverläufe erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem elementos de design personalizados do BIM Verdi e recursos de marca única, como fonte Moderat e gradientes alaranjados quentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, требующих индивидуальных элементов дизайна BIM Verdi и уникальных брендинговых функций, таких как шрифт Moderat и тёплые оранжевые градиенты.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يتطلب عناصر تصميم مخصصة لبرنامج BIM Verdi وميزات علامة تجارية فريدة مثل خط Moderat ودرجات البرتقالي الدافئة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate custom frontend code following the BIM Verdi design system, avoiding generic AI aesthetics by utilizing specific design elements such as Moderat font and warm orange gradients, and integrates seamlessly with HTML and CSS protocols.","zh":"赋予代理生成遵循BIM Verdi设计系统的自定义前端代码的能力，通过利用特定的设计元素（如Moderat字体和暖橙色渐变）避免通用AI美学，并与HTML和CSS协议无缝集成。","ja":"BIM Verdiデザインシステムに従ったカスタムフロントエンドコードを生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、Moderatフォントやウォームオレンジグラデーションなどの特定のデザイン要素を利用して汎用的なAIエステティックを回避し、HTMLおよびCSSプロトコルとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"BIM Verdi 디자인 시스템을 따르는 사용자 지정 프론트엔드 코드를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, Moderat 글꼴 및 따뜻한 오렌지 그라데이션과 같은 특정 디자인 요소를 사용하여 일반적인 AI 미학을 피하고, HTML 및 CSS 프로토콜과 무결점으로 통합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar código frontend personalizado siguiendo el sistema de diseño de BIM Verdi, evitando la estética de IA genérica al utilizar elementos de diseño específicos como la fuente Moderat y los degradados naranjas cálidos, e integra de forma transparente con los protocolos HTML y CSS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du code frontend personnalisé en suivant le système de conception de BIM Verdi, en évitant l''esthétique d''IA générique en utilisant des éléments de conception spécifiques tels que la police Moderat et les dégradés orange chauds, et s''intègre de manière transparente avec les protocoles HTML et CSS.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, benutzerdefinierten Frontend-Code zu generieren, der dem BIM Verdi-Designsystem folgt, indem sie eine generische KI-Ästhetik durch die Verwendung spezifischer Desigenelemente wie der Moderat-Schrift und warmer Orangefarbverläufe vermeiden und sich nahtlos in die HTML- und CSS-Protokolle integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar código de frontend personalizado seguindo o sistema de design do BIM Verdi, evitando estéticas de IA genéricas ao utilizar elementos de design específicos, como fonte Moderat e gradientes alaranjados quentes, e integra-se perfeitamente com os protocolos HTML e CSS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать индивидуальный фронтенд-код, следуя системе дизайна BIM Verdi, избегая общих эстетических решений ИИ путем использования конкретных элементов дизайна, таких как шрифт Moderat и тёплые оранжевые градиенты, и интегрируется без проблем с протоколами HTML и CSS.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على生成 رمز واجهة المستخدم المخصص الذي يتبع نظام تصميم BIM Verdi، وتجنب الأساليب الجمالية للذكاء الاصطناعي العامة من خلال استخدام عناصر تصميم محددة مثل خط Moderat ودرجات البرتقالي الدافئة، ويتكامل بسلاسة مع بروتوكولات HTML وCSS."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating custom frontend code for BIM Verdi projects","Creating unique design elements with Moderat font and warm orange gradients","Avoiding generic AI design defaults in BIM Verdi applications"],"zh":["为BIM Verdi项目生成自定义前端代码","使用Moderat字体和暖橙色渐变创建独特的设计元素","在BIM Verdi应用程序中避免通用AI设计默认值"],"ja":["BIM Verdiプロジェクトのカスタムフロントエンドコードを生成する","Moderatフォントやウォームオレンジグラデーションを使用して独自のデザイン要素を作成する","BIM Verdiアプリケーションで汎用的なAIデザインのデフォルトを回避する"],"ko":["BIM Verdi 프로젝트를 위한 사용자 지정 프론트엔드 코드 생성","Moderat 글꼴 및 따뜻한 오렌지 그라데이션을 사용하여 고유한 디자인 요소 생성","BIM Verdi 애플리케이션에서 일반적인 AI 디자인 기본값 피하기"],"es":["Generar código frontend personalizado para proyectos de BIM Verdi","Crear elementos de diseño únicos con la fuente Moderat y degradados naranjas cálidos","Evitar los valores predeterminados de diseño de IA genérica en aplicaciones de BIM Verdi"],"fr":["Générer du code frontend personnalisé pour les projets de BIM Verdi","Créer des éléments de conception uniques avec la police Moderat et les dégradés orange chauds","Éviter les valeurs par défaut de conception d''IA générique dans les applications de BIM Verdi"],"de":["Generieren von benutzerdefiniertem Frontend-Code für BIM Verdi-Projekte","Erstellen einzigartiger Desigenelemente mit der Moderat-Schrift und warmen Orangefarbverläufen","Vermeidung generischer KI-Designstandards in BIM Verdi-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Gerar código de frontend personalizado para projetos do BIM Verdi","Criar elementos de design únicos com fonte Moderat e gradientes alaranjados quentes","Evitar configurações de design de IA genéricas em aplicações do BIM Verdi"],"ru":["Генерировать индивидуальный фронтенд-код для проектов BIM Verdi","Создавать уникальные элементы дизайна с шрифтом Moderat и тёплыми оранжевыми градиентами","Избегать общих настроек дизайна ИИ в приложениях BIM Verdi"],"ar":["генерировать رمز واجهة المستخدم المخصص لمشاريع BIM Verdi","إنشاء عناصر تصميم فريدة بخط Moderat ودرجات البرتقالي الدافئة","تجنب إعدادات تصميم الذكاء الاصطناعي العامة في تطبيقات BIM Verdi"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the established BIM Verdi design system","Limited to frontend code generation for BIM Verdi (bimverdi.no)"],"zh":["需要遵守既定的BIM Verdi设计系统","仅限于BIM Verdi（bimverdi.no）的前端代码生成"],"ja":["既存のBIM Verdiデザインシステムに従う必要がある","BIM Verdi（bimverdi.no）へのフロントエンドコード生成のみ"],"ko":["설정된 BIM Verdi 디자인 시스템을 따라야 함","BIM Verdi(bimverdi.no) 프론트엔드 코드 생성 전용"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión al sistema de diseño de BIM Verdi establecido","Limitado a la generación de código frontend para BIM Verdi (bimverdi.no)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au système de conception de BIM Verdi établi","Limité à la génération de code frontend pour BIM Verdi (bimverdi.no)"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des etablierten BIM Verdi-Designsystems","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Frontend-Code für BIM Verdi (bimverdi.no)"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao sistema de design estabelecido do BIM Verdi","Limitado à geração de código de frontend para o BIM Verdi (bimverdi.no)"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения установленной системы дизайна BIM Verdi","Ограничен генерацией фронтенд-кода для BIM Verdi (bimverdi.no)"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بنظام التصميم المحدد لبرنامج BIM Verdi","محدود بالجملة لرمز واجهة المستخدم لموقع BIM Verdi (bimverdi.no)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"36dcc8747c57841c433fb3fd5755c4ab4c9bdd3fcd55bfa781c77f7f8b3af18d","qualityScore":39}');
