-smoke est un outil de tests de SAST et d''automatisation de pipelines basé sur Rust et CLI","de":"tundra-cli-smoke ist ein Tool für SAST-Tests und Pipeline-Automatisierung basierend auf Rust und CLI","pt":"O tundra-cli-smoke é uma ferramenta de teste de SAST para pipelines","ru":"ИИ Агент tundra-cli-smoke - это инструмент для тестирования SAST","ar":"تندرا-سي-إل-إي-سموك هو أداة اختبار الساست"},"features":{"en":["Runs cargo check and unit tests for at-cli","Performs skill discovery and validation using cargo run","Supports dry-run payload testing","Validates API contract drift from the CLI side","Triggers on CLI behavior changes in /Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/"],"zh":["支持 Rust 语言","集成 CI/CD 流程自动化","SAST 测试功能","CLI 行为变化检测","API 合同漂移验证"],"ja":["Rust 言語をサポート","CI/CD パイプライン自動化の統合","SAST テスト機能","CLI 動作の変更検知","API 契約のドリフト検証"],"ko":["Rust 언어 지원","CI/CD 파이프라인 자동화 통합","SAST 테스트 기능","CLI 동작 변경 감지","API 계약 드리프트 검증"],"es":["Pruebas de SAST con Rust","Automatización de pipelines con CLI","Validación de la compatibilidad de la API","Ejecución de pruebas unitarias con cargo test","Verificación de la configuración de la CLI con cargo run"],"fr":["Tests de SAST avec Rust","Automatisation de pipelines avec CLI","Validation de la compatibilité de l''API","Exécution de tests unitaires avec cargo test","Vérification de la configuration de la CLI avec cargo run"],"de":["SAST-Tests mit Rust","Pipeline-Automatisierung mit CLI","Überprüfung der API-Kompatibilität","Ausführung von Einheitstests mit cargo test","Überprüfung der CLI-Konfiguration mit cargo run"],"pt":["Suporte à Vibecoded Rust","Testes de SAST para pipelines","Automação de PR bot","CLI para execução de comandos","Validação de contrato de API","Suporte a dry-run de payloads"],"ru":["Поддержка Vibecoded Rust","Тестирование SAST для конвейеров","Автоматизация ботов PR","CLI для выполнения команд","Валидация контракта API","Поддержка сухого запуска полезных нагрузок"],"ar":["دعم فيبيكودد روست","اختبارات الساست للخطوط الأنابيب","توضيح بوت البريد الإلكتروني","واجهة سطر الأوامر لتشغيل الأوامر","تحقق من عقد واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دعم تشغيل khô полезных нагрузок"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use tundra-cli-smoke","tundra-cli-smoke setup guide","tundra-cli-smoke alternative","tundra-cli-smoke vs other CI/CD tools","automated SAST testing with Rust","CI/CD pipeline demos with tundra-cli-smoke","tundra-cli-smoke install","tundra-cli-smoke tutorial"],"zh":["Tundra CLI Smoke","Vibecoded Rust scaffold","SAST 测试","CI/CD 流程自动化","Rust 语言","CLI 行为变化检测","API 合同漂移验证"],"ja":["Tundra CLI Smoke","AIエージェント","SAST テスト","CI/CD パイプライン自動化","Rust 言語","CLI 動作の変更検知","API 契約のドリフト検証"],"ko":["Tundra CLI Smoke","AI 도구","SAST 테스트","CI/CD 파이프라인 자동화","Rust 언어","CLI 동작 변경 감지","API 계약 드리프트 검증"],"es":["tundra-cli-smoke","pruebas de SAST","automatización de pipelines","Rust","CLI","API","cargo test","cargo run","herramientas de pruebas","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["tundra-cli-smoke","tests de SAST","automatisation de pipelines","Rust","CLI","API","cargo test","cargo run","outils de tests","développement de logiciels"],"de":["tundra-cli-smoke","SAST-Tests","Pipeline-Automatisierung","Rust","CLI","API","cargo test","cargo run","Testtools","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["tundra-cli-smoke","teste de SAST","Vibecoded Rust","automação de pipelines","PR bot","CLI","validação de contrato de API","dry-run de payloads"],"ru":["ИИ Агент tundra-cli-smoke","тестирование SAST","Vibecoded Rust","автоматизация конвейеров","боты PR","CLI","валидация контракта API","сухой запуск полезных нагрузок"],"ar":["تندرا-سي-إل-إي-سموك","اختبارات الساست","فيبيكودد روست","توضيح خطوط الأنابيب","بوت البريد الإلكتروني","واجهة سطر الأوامر","تحقق من عقد واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تشغيل khô полезных нагрузок"]}},"owner":"ryanmaclean","repo":"tundra","repoPath":"ryanmaclean/tundra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T03:48:44Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tundra-cli-smoke","description":"Use when developing or refactoring at-cli. Runs deterministic smoke checks for run/agent/skill/doctor commands, including --dry-run and --out artifact paths.","bodyPreview":"# Tundra CLI Smoke\n\n## Trigger\nUse this skill whenever CLI behavior changes in `/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/`, or when validating API contract drift from the CLI side.\n\n## Required Checks\nRun these in order:\n\n1. Build and unit tests\n```bash\ncargo check -p at-cli\ncargo test -p at-cli\n```\n\n2. Skill discovery/validation\n```bash\ncargo run -p at-cli -- skill list -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j\ncargo run -p at-cli -- skill validate -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j\n```\n\n3. Dry-run payloa","body":"# Tundra CLI Smoke\n\n## Trigger\nUse this skill whenever CLI behavior changes in `/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/`, or when validating API contract drift from the CLI side.\n\n## Required Checks\nRun these in order:\n\n1. Build and unit tests\n```bash\ncargo check -p at-cli\ncargo test -p at-cli\n```\n\n2. Skill discovery/validation\n```bash\ncargo run -p at-cli -- skill list -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j\ncargo run -p at-cli -- skill validate -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j\n```\n\n3. Dry-run payload checks with artifacts\n```bash\nOUT1=\"$(mktemp -t at-run.XXXXXX).json\"\nOUT2=\"$(mktemp -t at-agent.XXXXXX).json\"\n\ncargo run -p at-cli -- run -t \"cli smoke run\" --dry-run --emit-prompt -j --out \"$OUT1\"\ncargo run -p at-cli -- agent run -r qa-reviewer -t \"cli smoke agent\" --dry-run -j --out \"$OUT2\"\n```\n\n4. Doctor checks\n```bash\nOUT3=\"$(mktemp -t at-doctor.XXXXXX).json\"\ncargo run -p at-cli -- doctor -p /Users/studio/rust-harness -j --out \"$OUT3\"\n```\n\n## Expected Invariants\n- `run` and `agent run` dry-runs must emit valid JSON with `mode: dry-run`.\n- `--out` must write a pretty JSON artifact file.\n- `skill validate` should return `ok: true` for clean repo skill definitions.\n- `doctor` JSON must include `api`, `project_exists`, `skill_count`, `env`, and `failures`.\n\n## Reporting Format\nAlways report:\n- files changed\n- commands executed\n- pass/fail by command\n- any artifact path used for validation\n- any regression found and the likely root cause\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:44:07.239Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust-based AI Agents needing automated SAST testing and CI/CD pipeline validation.","zh":"适合于需要自动化SAST测试和CI/CD流水线验证的Rust-based AI Agents。","ja":"RustベースのAIエージェントが自動化されたSASTテストとCI/CDパイプラインの検証を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"자동화된 SAST 테스트와 CI/CD 파이프라인 검증이 필요한 Rust 기반 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Rust que necesitan pruebas de SAST automatizadas y validación de tuberías de CI/CD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Rust nécessitant des tests de SAST automatisés et une validation de pipeline CI/CD.","de":"Perfekt für auf Rust basierende KI-Agents, die automatisierte SAST-Tests und CI/CD-Pipeline-Validierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Rust que precisam de testes de SAST automatizados e validação de pipeline CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Rust, которым требуется автоматизированное тестирование SAST и проверка конвейера CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تعتمد على لغة روست وتحتاج إلى اختبارات SAST آليّة وتأكيد خط أنابيب CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate CLI behavior testing and validate API contract drift using Cargo and Rust, streamlining development workflows with automated build and unit tests, skill discovery, and validation through Vibecoded Rust scaffolds.","zh":"赋予代理人使用Cargo和Rust自动化CLI行为测试的能力，并通过Vibecoded Rust脚手架验证API契约漂移，从而简化开发工作流程，包括自动构建和单元测试、技能发现和验证。","ja":"CargoとRustを使用してCLIの動作テストの自動化とVibecoded Rustスキャフォールディングを介したAPI契約のドリフトの検証を可能にし、自動ビルドとユニットテスト、スキル発見、検証を含む開発ワークフローを合理化します。","ko":"Cargo와 Rust를 사용하여 CLI 동작 테스트의 자동화와 Vibecoded Rust 스캐폴딩을 통해 API 계약의漂移을 검증할 수 있도록 하여 자동 빌드와 유닛 테스트, 스킬 발견 및 검증을 포함한 개발 워크플로우를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las pruebas de comportamiento de CLI y validar el deslizamiento del contrato de API utilizando Cargo y Rust, simplificando los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con compilaciones y pruebas unitarias automatizadas, descubrimiento de habilidades y validación a través de andamios de Rust de Vibecoded.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests de comportement de la CLI et de valider le glissement du contrat d''API en utilisant Cargo et Rust, en simplifiant les flux de travail de développement avec des builds et des tests unitaires automatisés, la découverte de compétences et la validation via des échafaudages Rust de Vibecoded.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, das Verhalten von CLI zu automatisieren und den API-Vertragsdrift mithilfe von Cargo und Rust zu überprüfen, indem Entwicklungsworkflows mit automatisierten Builds und Unit-Tests, Fähigkeitsentdeckung und Validierung durch Vibecoded-Rust-Gerüste gestreamlined werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatem a teste de comportamento do CLI e validem a deriva do contrato de API usando Cargo e Rust, simplificando os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com compilação e testes unitários automatizados, descoberta de habilidades e validação por meio de estruturas de Rust Vibecoded.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать тестирование поведения CLI и проверять дрейф контракта API с использованием Cargo и Rust, оптимизируя рабочие процессы разработки с автоматизированными сборкой и юнит-тестами, обнаружением навыков и проверкой через каркасы Rust Vibecoded.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توفير تطبيق سلوك CLI آلي وتأكيد انحراف عقد واجهة البرمجة باستخدام Cargo و لغة روست، وبذلك يُبسط تدفقات العمل التطويرية باستخدام بناء آلي وتحقق وحدة، اكتشاف المهارات، والتأكد من خلال الهياكل المصممة مسبقًا لغة روست من قبل Vibecoded."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating CLI behavior testing for Rust-based projects","Validating API contract drift from the CLI side","Streamlining CI/CD pipelines with automated build and unit tests"],"zh":["自动化Rust-based项目的CLI行为测试","验证API契约从CLI侧的漂移","使用自动化构建和单元测试简化CI/CD流水线"],"ja":["RustベースのプロジェクトのCLI動作テストの自動化","CLI側からのAPI契約のドリフトの検証","自動ビルドとユニットテストを使用してCI/CDパイプラインを合理化"],"ko":["Rust 기반 프로젝트의 CLI 동작 테스트 자동화","CLI 측면의 API 계약의漂移 검증","자동 빌드 및 유닛 테스트를 사용하여 CI/CD 파이프라인을 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de comportamiento de CLI para proyectos basados en Rust","Validar el deslizamiento del contrato de API desde el lado de la CLI","Optimizar las tuberías de CI/CD con compilaciones y pruebas unitarias automatizadas"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de comportement de la CLI pour les projets basés sur Rust","Valider le glissement du contrat d''API du côté de la CLI","Optimiser les pipelines de CI/CD avec des builds et des tests unitaires automatisés"],"de":["Automatisieren von CLI-Verhaltens-Tests für auf Rust basierende Projekte","Überprüfen des API-Vertragsdrifts von der CLI-Seite","Optimieren von CI/CD-Pipelines mit automatisierten Builds und Unit-Tests"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de comportamento do CLI para projetos baseados em Rust","Validar a deriva do contrato de API do lado do CLI","Otimizar pipelines de CI/CD com compilação e testes unitários automatizados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование поведения CLI для проектов на основе Rust","Проверять дрейф контракта API со стороны CLI","Оптимизировать конвейеры CI/CD с автоматизированной сборкой и юнит-тестами"],"ar":["تعزيز اختبارات سلوك واجهة سطر الأوامر الآليّة لمشاريع تعتمد على لغة روست","تأكيد انحراف عقد واجهة البرمجة من جانب واجهة سطر الأوامر","تحسين خطوط أنابيب CI/CD باستخدام بناء آلي وتحقق وحدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cargo and Rust installation","Limited to Vibecoded Rust scaffolds","Dependent on specific directory structure (/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)"],"zh":["需要安装Cargo和Rust","仅限于Vibecoded Rust脚手架","依赖于特定的目录结构(/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)"],"ja":["CargoとRustのインストールが必要","Vibecoded Rustスキャフォールディングのみに対応","特定のディレクトリ構造(/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)に依存"],"ko":["Cargo와 Rust의 설치가 필요합니다.","Vibecoded Rust 스캐폴딩만 지원","특정 디렉토리 구조(/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Cargo y Rust","Limitado a andamios de Rust de Vibecoded","Dependiente de una estructura de directorio específica (/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Cargo et Rust","Limité aux échafaudages Rust de Vibecoded","Dépendant d''une structure de répertoire spécifique (/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)"],"de":["Benötigt Installation von Cargo und Rust","Begrenzt auf Vibecoded-Rust-Gerüste","Abhängig von einer spezifischen Verzeichnisstruktur (/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Cargo e Rust","Limitado a estruturas de Rust Vibecoded","Dependente de estrutura de diretório específica (/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)"],"ru":["Требуется установка Cargo и Rust","Ограничен каркасами Rust Vibecoded","Зависит от конкретной структуры директории (/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Cargo و لغة روست","محدود بهياكل لغة روست المصممة مسبقًا من قبل Vibecoded","يعتمد على هيكل دليل معين (/Users/studio/rust-harness/crates/at-cli/)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ed38774cd43f3932bc22cdcafd5961ad71435e97d554b1e78dbea03d0c72ccd5","qualityScore":39}');
