s d''interaction pour MC-ORG","de":"docs-htmx ist eine Sammlung von HTMX-Hilfsfunktionen und Interaktionsmustern für MC-ORG","pt":"O docs-htmx é um conjunto de funções de ajuda HTMX para desenvolvedores","ru":"Docs-htmx - это набор функций HTMX для разработчиков, использующих ИИ Агенты","ar":"docs-htmx هو مجموعة من وظائف مساعدة HTMX للمطورين"},"features":{"en":["Provides HTMX helper functions via hx.kt","Supports HTTP methods like hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch, and hxDelete","Includes hxDeleteWithConfirm for delete operations with confirmation modals","Utilizes Kotlin for HTMX interaction patterns","Offers a reference for HTMX patterns in MC-ORG"],"zh":["hx.kt 帮助函数，包括 hxGet、hxPost、hxPut、hxPatch 和 hxDelete","自定义删除确认模态框组件","支持 HTTP 方法，包括 GET、POST、PUT、PATCH 和 DELETE","提供 HTMX 模式和交互","支持 Kotlin 语言"],"ja":["hx.kt ヘルパー関数、hxGet、hxPost、hxPut、hxPatch、hxDelete を含む","カスタム削除確認モーダルコンポーネント","HTTP メソッドのサポート、GET、POST、PUT、PATCH、DELETE を含む","HTMX パターンとインタラクションの提供","Kotlin 言語のサポート"],"ko":["hx.kt 헬퍼 함수, hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch 및 hxDelete 포함","사용자 지정 삭제 확인 모달 구성 요소","HTTP 메서드 지원, GET, POST, PUT, PATCH 및 DELETE 포함","HTMX 패턴 및 상호작용 제공","Kotlin 언어 지원"],"es":["Funciones hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch y hxDelete","Patrones de interacción para MC-ORG","Soporte para métodos HTTP","Eliminación con confirmación modal","Integración con componentes personalizados de MC-ORG"],"fr":["Fonctions hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch et hxDelete","Modèles d''interaction pour MC-ORG","Prise en charge des méthodes HTTP","Suppression avec confirmation modale","Intégration avec des composants personnalisés de MC-ORG"],"de":["Funktionen hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch und hxDelete","Interaktionsmuster für MC-ORG","Unterstützung für HTTP-Methoden","Löschung mit Bestätigungsmodal","Integration mit benutzerdefinierten Komponenten von MC-ORG"],"pt":["Funções de ajuda HTMX para HTTP","Métodos de requisição HTTP personalizados","Suporte a confirmação de exclusão","Integração com componentes personalizados","Suporte a URLs personalizadas"],"ru":["Функции HTMX для HTTP","Пользовательские методы запроса HTTP","Поддержка подтверждения удаления","Интеграция с пользовательскими компонентами","Поддержка пользовательских URL"],"ar":["وظائف مساعدة HTMX لبروتوكول HTTP","طرق طلب HTTP مخصصة","دعم للتأكيد على الحذف","التكامل مع المكونات المخصصة","دعم للعناوين URL المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use docs-htmx","docs-htmx setup guide","HTMX helper functions","Kotlin HTMX integration","docs-htmx alternative","HTMX patterns reference"],"zh":["docs-htmx","HTMX 模式","hx.kt","Kotlin","HTTP 方法","AI 工具","HTMX 交互","自定义组件","删除确认模态框"],"ja":["docs-htmx","HTMX パターン","hx.kt","Kotlin","HTTP メソッド","AI エージェント","HTMX インタラクション","カスタムコンポーネント","削除確認モーダル"],"ko":["docs-htmx","HTMX 패턴","hx.kt","Kotlin","HTTP 메서드","인공지능 에이전트","HTMX 상호작용","사용자 지정 구성 요소","삭제 확인 모달"],"es":["docs-htmx","HTMX","MC-ORG","desarrollo web","patrones de interacción","funciones de ayuda","métodos HTTP","eliminación con confirmación","integración con componentes personalizados"],"fr":["docs-htmx","HTMX","MC-ORG","développement web","modèles d''interaction","fonctions d''aide","méthodes HTTP","suppression avec confirmation","intégration avec des composants personnalisés"],"de":["docs-htmx","HTMX","MC-ORG","Webentwicklung","Interaktionsmuster","Hilfsfunktionen","HTTP-Methoden","Löschung mit Bestätigung","Integration mit benutzerdefinierten Komponenten"],"pt":["docs-htmx","funções de ajuda HTMX","desenvolvimento web","HTTP","métodos de requisição","confirmação de exclusão","componentes personalizados","URLs personalizadas"],"ru":["docs-htmx","функции HTMX","разработка веб-приложений","HTTP","методы запроса","подтверждение удаления","пользовательские компоненты","пользовательские URL","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["docs-htmx","وظائف مساعدة HTMX","تطوير الويب","HTTP","طرق طلب","تأكيد الحذف","مكونات مخصصة","عناوين URL مخصصة","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"evengul","repo":"mc-org","repoPath":"evengul/mc-org","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T10:35:46Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs-htmx","description":"HTMX helper functions and interaction patterns for MC-ORG. Use when using hx* helper functions, writing HTMX attributes, implementing form submissions, delete-with-confirm, out-of-band swaps, or inline editing patterns.","bodyPreview":"# HTMX Patterns Reference\n\nHTMX helper functions and interaction patterns for MC-ORG.\n\n---\n\n## HTMX Helper Functions (hx.kt)\n\n```kotlin\n// HTTP methods\nfun HTMLTag.hxGet(value: String)\nfun HTMLTag.hxPost(value: String)\nfun HTMLTag.hxPut(value: String)\nfun HTMLTag.hxPatch(value: String)\nfun HTMLTag.hxDelete(value: String)\n\n// Delete with confirmation modal (custom MC-ORG component)\nfun HTMLTag.hxDeleteWithConfirm(\n    url: String,\n    title: String,\n    description: String,\n    warning: String,","body":"# HTMX Patterns Reference\n\nHTMX helper functions and interaction patterns for MC-ORG.\n\n---\n\n## HTMX Helper Functions (hx.kt)\n\n```kotlin\n// HTTP methods\nfun HTMLTag.hxGet(value: String)\nfun HTMLTag.hxPost(value: String)\nfun HTMLTag.hxPut(value: String)\nfun HTMLTag.hxPatch(value: String)\nfun HTMLTag.hxDelete(value: String)\n\n// Delete with confirmation modal (custom MC-ORG component)\nfun HTMLTag.hxDeleteWithConfirm(\n    url: String,\n    title: String,\n    description: String,\n    warning: String,\n    confirmText: String? = null  // if set, user must type this to confirm\n)\n\n// Targeting and swapping\nfun HTMLTag.hxTarget(value: String)    // CSS selector for swap target\nfun HTMLTag.hxSwap(value: String)      // swap strategy (see table below)\n\n// Additional attributes\nfun HTMLTag.hxConfirm(value: String)   // simple confirm dialog\nfun HTMLTag.hxTrigger(value: String)   // e.g., \"load\", \"click\", \"change\"\nfun HTMLTag.hxPushUrl(value: String)   // update browser URL\n\n// Include additional form data\nfun HTMLTag.hxInclude(value: String)   // CSS selector for extra inputs to include\n\n// Out-of-band swaps (update multiple elements in one response)\nfun HTMLTag.hxOutOfBands(locator: String)  // \"true\" or element spec\n\n// Error targeting\nfun HTMLTag.hxErrorTarget(target: String)\nfun HTMLTag.hxErrorTarget(target: String, errorCode: String)\n\n// Extensions\nfun HTMLTag.hxExtension(value: String)\n```\n\n## HTMX Swap Strategies\n\n| Value | Effect |\n|-------|--------|\n| `innerHTML` | Replace inner content (default) |\n| `outerHTML` | Replace entire element |\n| `beforeend` | Append to end of target |\n| `afterbegin` | Prepend to beginning of target |\n| `delete` | Remove target element |\n\n## Response Helpers (htmxResponseUtils.kt)\n\n```kotlin\n// HTMX redirect — sets HX-Redirect header (no full page reload)\nsuspend fun ApplicationCall.clientRedirect(path: String)\n\n// Error responses — sets HX-ReTarget and HX-ReSwap for error display\nsuspend fun ApplicationCall.respondBadRequest(\n    errorHtml: String = \"An error occurred\",\n    target: String = \"#error-message\",\n    swap: String = \"innerHTML\"\n)\nsuspend fun ApplicationCall.respondNotFound(errorHtml: String = \"Not found\", ...)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form submission\n\n```kotlin\n// Template\nform {\n    id = \"create-project-form\"\n    hxPost(\"/app/worlds/${worldId}/projects\")\n    hxTarget(\"#create-project-form\")\n\n    input(classes = \"form-control\") { name = \"name\"; placeholder = \"Project name\" }\n    button(classes = \"btn btn--action\") { type = ButtonType.submit; +\"Create\" }\n}\n\n// Handler response (replaces the form)\nrespondHtml(createHTML().div {\n    id = \"create-project-form\"\n    div(\"notice notice--success\") { +\"Project created successfully!\" }\n})\n```\n\n### Update action (button trigger)\n\n```kotlin\n// Template\nbutton(classes = \"btn btn--action\") {\n    hxPut(\"/app/worlds/${worldId}/projects/${projectId}/stage\")\n    hxTarget(\"#project-stage\")\n    +\"Advance Stage\"\n}\n\n// Handler response\nrespondHtml(createHTML().div {\n    id = \"project-stage\"\n    span(\"badge badge--success\") { +\"Building\" }\n})\n```\n\n### Delete with confirmation\n\n```kotlin\n// Template\nbutton(classes = \"btn btn--danger\") {\n    hxDeleteWithConfirm(\n        url = \"/app/worlds/${worldId}/projects/${projectId}\",\n        title = \"Delete Project\",\n        description = \"Are you sure you want to delete this project?\",\n        warning = \"This will also delete all tasks and cannot be undone.\",\n        confirmText = \"DELETE\"  // user must type this\n    )\n    +\"Delete Project\"\n}\n\n// Handler response (after deletion)\nrespondHtml(createHTML().div {\n    id = \"project-card\"  // replaced/removed element\n    div(\"notice notice--success\") { +\"Project deleted.\" }\n})\n```\n\n### Dynamic content load on page load\n\n```kotlin\ndiv {\n    id = \"task-list\"\n    hxGet(\"/app/worlds/${worldId}/projects/${projectId}/tasks\")\n    hxTrigger(\"load\")\n    +\"Loading tasks...\"\n}\n```\n\n### Out-of-band swap (update multiple elements)\n\n```kotlin\n// Response updates both #project-list (main) and #notification-count (OOB)\nrespondHtml(createHTML().div {\n    id = \"project-list\"\n    projectListContent(projects)\n\n    span {\n        id = \"notification-count\"\n        hxOutOfBands(\"true\")\n        +\"${notificationCount}\"\n    }\n})\n```\n\n### Include extra inputs in request\n\n```kotlin\nbutton(classes = \"btn btn--action\") {\n    hxPost(\"/app/worlds/${worldId}/tasks\")\n    hxTarget(\"#task-list\")\n    hxInclude(\"#task-form-inputs\")  // include inputs from another element\n    +\"Add Task\"\n}\n```\n\n### Inline editing\n\n```kotlin\n// View mode\ndiv {\n    id = \"project-description\"\n    span { +project.description }\n    button(classes = \"btn btn--ghost btn--sm\") {\n        hxGet(\"/app/worlds/${worldId}/projects/${projectId}/edit/description\")\n        hxTarget(\"#project-description\")\n        +\"Edit\"\n    }\n}\n\n// Handler returns edit form (replaces #project-description)\nrespondHtml(createHTML().div {\n    id = \"project-description\"\n    form {\n        hxPut(\"/app/worlds/${worldId}/projects/${projectId}/description\")\n        hxTarget(\"#project-description\")\n        textarea(classes = \"form-control\") { name = \"description\"; +project.description }\n        div(\"cluster cluster--sm\") {\n            button(classes = \"btn btn--action\") { +\"Save\" }\n            button(classes = \"btn btn--neutral\") {\n                hxGet(\"/app/worlds/${worldId}/projects/${projectId}\")\n                hxTarget(\"#project-description\")\n                +\"Cancel\"\n            }\n        }\n    }\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- **GET endpoints** return full pages via `createPage(user, \"Title\") { ... }`\n- **PUT/PATCH/POST/DELETE endpoints** return HTML fragments (NOT full pages)\n- Response element `id` must match `hxTarget` selector\n- Always specify `hxTarget` — never rely on defaults\n- Use semantic HTTP: GET=read, POST=create, PUT=replace, PATCH=partial, DELETE=remove\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:52:03.904Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Kotlin-based AI Agents requiring efficient HTMX development and interaction patterns.","zh":"适用于需要高效HTMX开发和交互模式的Kotlin-based AI Agents。","ja":"KotlinベースのAIエージェントが効率的なHTMX開発と相互作用パターンを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 HTMX 개발 및 상호 작용 패턴이 필요한 Kotlin 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Kotlin que requieren un desarrollo y patrones de interacción de HTMX eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Kotlin nécessitant un développement et des modèles d''interaction HTMX efficaces.","de":"Ideal für auf Kotlin basierende KI-Agents, die eine effiziente HTMX-Entwicklung und Interaktionsmuster erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em Kotlin que requerem desenvolvimento eficiente de HTMX e padrões de interação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Kotlin, требующих эффективного развития HTMX и шаблонов взаимодействия.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين القائمين على Kotlin الذين يتطلبون تطوير HTMX وفعالية الأنماط التفاعلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage HTMX helper functions for HTTP methods like hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch, and hxDelete, streamlining development with Kotlin and facilitating seamless interaction with HTMX components, including custom confirmation modals for delete operations.","zh":"赋予代理使用HTMX辅助函数来利用HTTP方法，如hxGet、hxPost、hxPut、hxPatch和hxDelete，简化Kotlin开发并促进与HTMX组件（包括自定义删除操作确认模态）的无缝交互。","ja":"エージェントに、hxGet、hxPost、hxPut、hxPatch、hxDeleteなどのHTTPメソッドを使用するHTMXヘルパー関数を利用できるようにし、Kotlin開発を簡素化し、カスタム削除操作の確認モーダルを含むHTMXコンポーネントとのシームレスな相互作用を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch 및 hxDelete와 같은 HTTP 메소드를 사용하는 HTMX 헬퍼 함수를 활용할 수 있도록 하여 Kotlin 개발을 간소화하고 커스텀 삭제 작업 확인 모달을 포함한 HTMX 컴포넌트와의 무결점 상호 작용을 용이하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar las funciones de ayuda de HTMX para métodos HTTP como hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch y hxDelete, simplificando el desarrollo con Kotlin y facilitando una interacción fluida con los componentes de HTMX, incluyendo modales de confirmación personalizados para operaciones de eliminación.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser les fonctions d''aide HTMX pour les méthodes HTTP comme hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch et hxDelete, simplifiant ainsi le développement avec Kotlin et facilitant une interaction fluide avec les composants HTMX, y compris les modales de confirmation personnalisées pour les opérations de suppression.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, HTMX-Hilfsfunktionen für HTTP-Methoden wie hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch und hxDelete zu nutzen, um die Entwicklung mit Kotlin zu rationalisieren und eine nahtlose Interaktion mit HTMX-Komponenten zu ermöglichen, einschließlich benutzerdefinierter Bestätigungsmodale für Löschvorgänge.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar funções auxiliares do HTMX para métodos HTTP como hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch e hxDelete, simplificando o desenvolvimento com Kotlin e facilitando a interação sem problemas com componentes do HTMX, incluindo modais de confirmação personalizados para operações de exclusão.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать вспомогательные функции HTMX для методов HTTP, таких как hxGet, hxPost, hxPut, hxPatch и hxDelete, упрощая разработку на Kotlin и обеспечивая бесшовное взаимодействие с компонентами HTMX, включая пользовательские модальные окна подтверждения для операций удаления.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الاستفادة من وظائف المساعدة HTMX لأسلوب HTTP مثل hxGet و hxPost و hxPut و hxPatch و hxDelete، وبذلك يُبسّط تطوير Kotlin ويتодейств مع مكونات HTMX بشكل سلس، بما في ذلك نماذج تأكيد مخصصة للعمليات الحذف."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing hxGet for data retrieval","Utilizing hxPost for form submissions","Creating custom delete confirmation modals with hxDeleteWithConfirm"],"zh":["实现hxGet进行数据检索","利用hxPost进行表单提交","使用hxDeleteWithConfirm创建自定义删除确认模态"],"ja":["hxGetを使用したデータの取得の実装","hxPostを使用したフォームの送信","hxDeleteWithConfirmを使用したカスタム削除確認モーダルの作成"],"ko":["hxGet을 사용한 데이터检索 구현","hxPost를 사용한 양식 제출","hxDeleteWithConfirm를 사용한 커스텀 삭제 확인 모달 생성"],"es":["Implementar hxGet para la recuperación de datos","Utilizar hxPost para la presentación de formularios","Crear modales de confirmación personalizados con hxDeleteWithConfirm"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre hxGet pour la récupération de données","Utiliser hxPost pour les soumissions de formulaires","Créer des modales de confirmation personnalisées avec hxDeleteWithConfirm"],"de":["hxGet für die Datenerfassung implementieren","hxPost für die Formularübermittlung nutzen","Benutzerdefinierte Bestätigungsmodale mit hxDeleteWithConfirm erstellen"],"pt":["Implementação do hxGet para recuperação de dados","Utilização do hxPost para envio de formulários","Criação de modais de confirmação de exclusão personalizados com hxDeleteWithConfirm"],"ru":["Реализация hxGet для извлечения данных","Использование hxPost для отправки форм","Создание пользовательских модальных окон подтверждения удаления с помощью hxDeleteWithConfirm"],"ar":["تنفيذ hxGet لاسترجاع البيانات","استخدام hxPost لإرسال الاستمارات","إنشاء نماذج تأكيد الحذف المخصصة باستخدام hxDeleteWithConfirm"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kotlin compatibility","Specific to HTMX development","Dependent on MC-ORG component for custom delete confirmation modals"],"zh":["需要Kotlin兼容性","特定于HTMX开发","依赖于MC-ORG组件用于自定义删除确认模态"],"ja":["Kotlinの互換性が必要","HTMX開発に特有","カスタム削除確認モーダルにMC-ORGコンポーネントに依存"],"ko":["Kotlin 호환성이 필요","HTMX 개발에 특정","커스텀 삭제 확인 모달에 MC-ORG 컴포넌트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Kotlin","Específico para el desarrollo de HTMX","Dependiente del componente MC-ORG para modales de confirmación personalizados de eliminación"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité Kotlin","Spécifique au développement HTMX","Dépendant du composant MC-ORG pour les modales de confirmation personnalisées de suppression"],"de":["Benötigt Kotlin-Kompatibilität","Spezifisch für die HTMX-Entwicklung","Von der MC-ORG-Komponente abhängig für benutzerdefinierte Bestätigungsmodale für Löschvorgänge"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com Kotlin","Específico para desenvolvimento de HTMX","Dependente do componente MC-ORG para modais de confirmação de exclusão personalizados"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Kotlin","Конкретно для разработки HTMX","Зависит от компонента MC-ORG для пользовательских модальных окон подтверждения удаления"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع Kotlin","محدد لتطوير HTMX","يعتمد على مكون MC-ORG لنماذج تأكيد الحذف المخصصة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8e378611757107f4c190a40f5064f815d5312f072fe98ffda0222baae8a099b8","qualityScore":39}');
