INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('created-by-forge/synchrony-social/pillar-analysis', 'pillar-analysis', 'created-by-forge', 'synchrony-social', 'community', 'pillar-analysis created-by-forge synchrony-social community Pillar-analysis is a skill that analyzes a single content pillar across all platforms and time periods, providing insights into performance and areas for improvement. It benefits developers and marketers seeking to optimize their campaigns. pillar-analysis是一种分析单个内容支柱的技术，回答如何优化其性能和哪里最有效的问题 pillar-analysisは、単一のコンテンツピラーを分析する技術であり、そのパフォーマンスを最適化し、どこで最も効果的かを回答する pillar-analysis는 단일 콘텐츠 기둥을 분석하는 기술로, 그 성능을 최적화하고 어디서 가장 효과적인지回答 Análisis de pilares es una herramienta que analiza un pilar de contenido en todas las plataformas y periodos de tiempo disponibles L''analyse de piliers est un outil qui analyse un pilier de contenu sur toutes les plateformes et périodes de temps disponibles Die Pillar-Analyse ist ein Tool, das einen Content-Pillar auf allen Plattformen und verfügbaren Zeitperioden analysiert A análise de pilar é uma técnica que analisa um pilar de conteúdo específico em diferentes plataformas e períodos de tempo Анализ пилара - это метод, который анализирует отдельный контент-пилар на разных платформах и во времени تحليل العمود هو تقنية تحليل ركن محتوى معين على منصات ومراحل زمنية مختلفة how to use pillar-analysis what is pillar-analysis pillar-analysis alternative pillar-analysis vs competitor pillar-analysis install pillar-analysis setup guide content pillar optimization campaign performance analysis pillar-analysis AI工具 内容支柱分析 性能优化 ER公式 基准分析 Loads knowledge from metric-glossary.md for ER formulas and benchmarks Supports analysis of content pillars across multiple platforms Provides insights into campaign performance over available time periods Triggers analysis with user requests like ''analyze [pillar]'' or ''pillar deep dive'' Utilizes knowledge from knowledge/metric-glossary.md for informed analysis Pillar-analysis is a technique that evaluates the performance of a specific content pillar, providing answers to questions like ''How is this pillar performing?'' and ''What should we do differently?''');
